#. ~ Description of profession "Tabletop Gaming" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As the Game Master, you've guided players' journeys through dungeons and "
"fortresses.  Now, you're the last member of your party."
msgstr ""
"В качестве Мастера игры, вы помогали игрокам путешествовать по подземельям и "
"крепостям. Теперь вы последний член своей группы."

#. ~ Description of profession "Tabletop Gaming" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
