#. ~ Description of profession "Caffeine Dependence" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Caffeine gave you life and without it you are nothing.  You'd better find a "
"steady supply, and fast."
msgstr ""
"Кофеин дал вам жизнь, и без него вы никто.  Вам лучше найти стабильный запас "
