msgid ""
"Maybe you're a certified locksmith, a career burglar, or an intense "
"hobbyist.  Regardless, you've spent so long picking locks you could pop most "
"open in under a minute easy, with the right tools."
msgstr ""
"Возможно, вы дипломированный слесарь, профессиональный взломщик или "
