msgstr "Вы спускаетесь на транспорт."

#. ~ Message after descent with ""
#. ~ Message after descent with "furn_LADDER"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You climb down the ladder."
msgstr "Вы спускаетесь по лестнице."

#. ~ Message after descent with "furn_CLIMBABLE"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You climb down."
msgstr "Вы спускаетесь вниз."

#. ~ Message after descent with "ability_WALL_CLING"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You crawl down the wall."
msgstr "Вы сползаете вниз по стене."

#. ~ Message after descent with "ability_INSECT_ARMS_OK"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You crawl down using all your arms."
msgstr "Вы сползаете вниз, используя все свои руки."

#. ~ Message after descent with ""
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You descend effortlessly."
msgstr "Вы спускаетесь без особых усилий."

#. ~ Message after descent with "ability_VINES2_deploy"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You descend on your vines, though leaving a part of you behind stings."
msgstr "Вы спускаетесь на ваших лианах, хоть оставить часть себя было больно."

#. ~ Message after descent with "ability_VINES3"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You effortlessly descend using your vines."
msgstr "Вы без особых усилий спускаетесь вниз, используя свои лианы."

#. ~ Message after descent with "ability_VINES3_deploy"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You effortlessly lower yourself and leave a vine rooted for future use."
msgstr "Вы легко спускаетесь и оставляете укоренившуюся лиану."

#. ~ Message after descent with "ability_VINES2"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You gingerly descend using your vines."
msgstr "Вы осторожно спускаетесь, используя свои лианы."

#. ~ Message before descent with ""
#. ~ Message before descent with "furn_ROPE"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You grasp the rope firmly and rappel down."
msgstr "Вы крепко хватаетесь за веревку и спускаетесь вниз."

#. ~ Message after descent with "item_stepladder"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You lower the ladder into place and climb down."
msgstr "Вы опускаете лестницу и спускаетесь вниз."

#. ~ Message after descent with "null"
#. ~ Message after descent with "default"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You lower yourself from the ledge."
msgstr "Вы опускатесь с уступа."

#. ~ Message before descent with "item_grapnel"
#: data/json/climbing.json
msgid "You tie the rope around your waist and begin to rappel down."
msgstr "Вы обвязываете верёвку вокруг пояса и начинаете спускаться вниз."

