msgid "You have died.  Continue as one of your followers?"
msgstr ""
"Вы погибли. Желаете ли вы продолжить игру за одного из ваших компаньонов?"

#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_PLAY_PIANO"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/misc_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "music"
msgstr "музыку"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "changing_reqs_not_met"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
msgstr "<CHANGING_ENDS>"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "changing_failed"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
msgstr "<CHANGING_FAILED>"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "changing_successful"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
msgstr "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Every muscle you have begins to minutely spasm and cramp as your body starts "
"morphing, slowly, in unearthly new ways."
msgstr ""
"Каждый ваш мускул начинает поминутно сокращаться и расслабляться, когда ваше "
"тело начинает медленно трансформироваться в новую чужую оболочку."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"It won't be long now.  Your innards flex and twist in anticipatory "
"contortions."
msgstr ""
"Ненадолго ваши внутренности изгибаются и скручиваются в предвкушении "
"движения."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The strain of mutation fades, leaving a throbbing sensation like a bad "
"headache."
msgstr ""
"Напряжение мутации исчезает, оставляя ощущение пульсации, похожее на сильную "
"головную боль. Или её остаток."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Tiny ripples begin appearing in your skin and radiating outward like waves.  "
"It is indescribably uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"Крошечная рябь пробегает по вашей коже, словно волны. Это чертовски неудобно."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You begin to feel a sickening ache, the feeling of your cells tearing apart "
"and recombining in strange new patterns."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "You can palpably feel the churning sensation within fade."
msgstr ""
"Вы чувствуете, как пульсация внутри утихает, ваша мутация прерывается из-за "
"нехватки питательных веществ."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "changing_mutate2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "changing_mutate"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "You feel a deep, churning sensation fill your body."
msgstr "Глубокое, бурлящее ощущение наполняет ваше тело."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "You feel a shift in your body, but it quickly reverts."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете движение в теле, но оно быстро прекращается."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You feel as though you're on the cusp of something, if you just give it a "
"bit more time…"
msgstr ""
"Вы чувствуете, что находитесь на грани чего-то. Если бы у чего-то было бы "
"больше времени…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "You feel your chest wriggle and begin to palpitate.  Here we go."
msgstr ""
"Вы чувствуете, как сжимается ваша грудь и начинает пульсирвать. Началось."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You're pulled back to reality as your body stops warping, leaving you in "
"your current state for the time being."
msgstr ""
"Вы возвращаетесь к реальности в текущей форме, когда ваше тело перестаёт "
"деформироваться."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your body is slowly reshaping itself!"
msgstr "Ваше тело медленно трансформируется!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your flesh has taken on an impatient wriggling sensation."
msgstr "Ваша плоть в извивающимся нетерпеливом ожидании."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your skin feels like wax.  Or wet clay."
msgstr "Ваша кожа похожа на воск. Или мокрую глину."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your vision swims.  You feel dizzy."
msgstr "Ваше зрение уплывает. Вы чувствуете головокружение."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_SHORT_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You  are too tired to perform a jump."
msgstr "Вы слишком устали, чтобы выполнить прыжок."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_WHIPPING_TONGUE_PULL"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_HARPOON_TONGUE_STAB"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You are too tired to catch anything with your tongue."
msgstr "Вы слишком устали, чтобы что-либо уловить языком."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_FELINE_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_CRUSHING_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_AVIAN_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_RAPTOR_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_INSECT_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You are too tired to perform a jump."
msgstr "Вы слишком устали, чтобы выполнить прыжок."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_BULL_CHARGE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You are too tired to run."
msgstr "Ты слишком устал, чтобы бежать."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_BULL_CHARGE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You can't move properly, so charging is out of the question."
msgstr ""
"Вы не можете нормально двигаться, так что о зарядке не может быть и речи."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_FELINE_LEAP"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SHORT_LEAP"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_CRUSHING_LEAP"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_AVIAN_LEAP"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_RAPTOR_LEAP"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_INSECT_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You can't move properly, so leaping is out of the question."
msgstr ""
"Вы не можете нормально двигаться, так что о прыжках не может быть и речи."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_CRUSHING_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You crouch down and leap forward with all your might."
msgstr "Вы приседаете и изо всех сил прыгаете вперед."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOLUM3_activated"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You launch a glob of bioluminescent material!"
msgstr "Вы запускаете комок биолюминесцентного материала!"

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_INSECT_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You launch yourself forward, wings buzzing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_AVIAN_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_RAPTOR_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You leap forward, talons ready to strike."
msgstr "Вы прыгаете вперед, когти готовы нанести удар."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_BULL_CHARGE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You lower your head and charge."
msgstr "Ты опускаешь голову и бросаешься в атаку."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_SLIME_SPRAY"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You spit out some goo onto your enemies!"
msgstr "Вы выплёвываете слизь на ваших врагов!"

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_FELINE_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You squat down, build up tension in your legs, then release, launching "
"yourself quite a distance."
msgstr ""
"Вы приседаете, накапливаете напряжение в ногах, а затем отпускаетесь, "
"запуская себя на большое расстояние."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_SHORT_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You take a big leap forward."
msgstr "Вы делаете большой шаг вперед."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOLUM3_activated"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "Your body is too starved to activate your bioluminescent flare."
msgstr "Ваше тело слишком истощено, чтобы активировать биолюминесцентный свет."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_SLIME_SPRAY"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "Your body is too starved to activate your slime spray."
msgstr "Ваше тело слишком истощено, чтобы активировать брызги слизи."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_WHIPPING_TONGUE_PULL"
#. ~ Description of spell "Whipping Tongue"
#. ~ Description of spell "Harpoon Tongue Stab"
#. ~ Description of spell "Harpoon Tongue Pull"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid "Your tongue launches out to snag your target."
msgstr "Ваш язык высовывается, чтобы поймать цель."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_HARPOON_TONGUE_STAB"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "Your tongue launches out to spear your target."
msgstr "Ваш язык высовывается, чтобы пронзить цель."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "flowers_winter_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"A somber feeling comes over you as the last petals of your wilting flowers "
"fall from your head."
msgstr ""
"Мрачное чувство охватывает вас, когда последние лепестки увядающих цветов "
"падают с вашей головы."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "antlers_spring_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "An itching in your scalp signifies the growth of a new pair of antlers."
msgstr "Зуд кожи головы означает рост новой пары рогов."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "regrow_timer_lupine"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "regrow_timer_ursine"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "It looks like your coat has grown back in for the colder seasons."
msgstr "Похоже, ваша шерсть снова отросла к холодам."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "seasonal_affective_fall"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "It's only fall, but you already miss the summer sun."
msgstr "Сейчас только осень, но ты уже скучаешь по летнему солнцу."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "picked_rosebuds_fall"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Most of the fruits are beyond consideration, but you pick what you can and "
"discard the rest."
msgstr ""
"Большинство фруктов даже не подлежат рассмотрению, но вы выбираете что "
"можете, а остальное выбрасываете."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "leaves2_spring_summer_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "New green leaves are growing in on your head and arms."
msgstr "На вашей голове и руках растут новые зелёные листья."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "leaves3_spring_summer_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "New green leaves are growing in on your head and upper limbs."
msgstr "На вашей голове и верхних конечностях растут новые зелёные листья."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "rosebuds_spring_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Spring must be here, the new buds growing from your scalp are giving off a "
"lovely scent."
msgstr ""
"Должно быть, весна уже настала, новые бутоны, растущие на вашем скальпе, "
"источают прекрасный аромат."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EATHEALTH_active"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "Steam rises from your sweltering skin."
msgstr "От твоей разгоряченной кожи поднимается пар."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "leaves_winter_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "The grassy leaves on your head have succumbed to winter dormancy."
msgstr "Травянистые листья на вашей голове впали в зимнюю спячку."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "antlers_summer_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The last of the bloody velvet falls free.  Your antlers have grown to full "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Остатки кровавого бархата выпадают.  Твои рога выросли до полного размера."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "leaves2_winter_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "The last of your leaves fall, leaving your head and arms bare."
msgstr "Последние листья падают, оставляя голову и руки обнажёнными."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "leaves3_winter_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "The last of your leaves fall, leaving your head and upper limbs bare."
msgstr ""
"Последние листья падают, оставляя голову и верхние конечности обнажёнными."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "seasonal_affective_winter"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "The long, cold nights really get you feeling down."
msgstr ""
"Длинные, холодные ночи действительно заставляют вас чувствовать себя "
"подавленным."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "antlers_winter_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"They've been growing looser for some time, and finally with a tearing "
"sensation, your antlers come free."
msgstr ""
"Некоторое время они становились слабее, и, наконец, с ощущением разрыва ваши "
"рога высвободились."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "rosebuds_winter_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Winter claims the last few vestiges of your flowers, leaving your crown bare "
"of adornment."
msgstr ""
"Зима забирает последние остатки ваших цветов, оставляя вашу корону без "
"украшений."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin2_molt_timer2"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin3_molt_timer2"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You can hardly move in your tightening exoskeleton, and you feel a strong "
"impulse to hunker down somewhere safe."
msgstr ""
"Вы едва можете двигаться в своем стягивающем экзоскелете и чувствуете "
"сильный позыв спрятаться в безопасном месте."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_social2_penalty"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "You could use some friendly company."
msgstr "Вам бы сейчас не помешала компания друзей."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_insect_wings_shutoff"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have the stamina to keep buzzing."
msgstr "Вы слишком устали, чтобы махать крыльями."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "flowers_spring_summer_fall_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "You feel a giddy thrill as new flowers bloom from your scalp."
msgstr ""
"Вы чувствуете головокружительный трепет, когда на вашей голове распускаются "
"новые цветы."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "sneeze"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "You sneeze!"
msgstr "Вы чихаете!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_asocial2_penalty"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "You'd really rather be by yourself."
msgstr "Вы сейчас хотите побыть наедине."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "shed_summer_timer_lupine"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "shed_summer_timer_ursine"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You've been shedding for a while, and your coat feels noticeably lighter."
msgstr "Вы уже долго линяете, и ваша шерсть стала ощутимо легче."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "rosebuds_summer_timer"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "rosebuds_fall_timer_elfa"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your blossoms come into full bloom, sending a brief flush of warmth through "
"your body."
msgstr ""
"Ваши цветы распускаются в полной силе, посылая краткий прилив тепла по "
"вашему телу."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin2_molt_timer_3"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your exoskeleton grows steadily more rigid until you can no longer move.  "
"You strain against it for a few minutes, and it peels and cracks away in "
"chunks like a plaster mold, revealing a soft and tender new layer beneath."
msgstr ""
"Ваш экзоскелет становится всё более твёрдым, до тех пор, пока полностью не "
"заковывает вас. Вы несколько минут пытаетесь раздвинуть его, когда он "
"начинает отслаиваться и трескаться кусками, словно гипсовая форма, обнажая "
"под собой новый мягкий слой."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin2_molt_timer4"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin3_molt_timer4"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "Your exoskeleton has finished hardening."
msgstr "Ваш экзоскелет закончил затвердевать."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin3_molt_timer3"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your exoskeleton locks up around you like a straitjacket, completely "
"immobilizing you.  As you try to move, you begin to feel it painlessly rip, "
"opening a hole through which you can slowly emerge, raw, soft, and "
"vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"Ваш экзоскелет застегивается вокруг вас, как смирительная рубашка, полностью "
"обездвиживая вас. Когда вы пытаетесь двигаться, вы начинаете чувствовать, "
"как он безболезненно рвется, открывая отверстие, через которое вы медленно "
"выходите наружу, сырой, мягкий и уязвимый."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "hay_fever_spring_fall"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "hay_fever_summer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "Your eyes water and your nose itches."
msgstr "Ваши глаза слезятся и нос чешется."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "rosebuds_fall_timer_plant"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your flowers have withered away and died.  In their place, a few small "
"fruits hang from your head."
msgstr ""
"Ваши цветы завяли и умерли. Вместо них с вашей головы свисают несколько "
"маленьких фруктов."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ink_grand_spray"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "Your ink glands spray some ink into your attacker's eyes!"
msgstr "Ваши чернильные железы распыляют чернила в глаза нападающему!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "leaves_spring_summer_fall_timer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "Your leaves are looking green and healthy again."
msgstr "Ваши листья снова выглядят зелёными и здоровыми."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "leaves2_fall_timer"
