#. ~ Description of fault "Broken handle"
#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
msgid "Instead of a handle, there is just a small piece of wood that was left."
msgstr "Вместо ручки остался лишь небольшой кусочек дерева."

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
msgid "No handle"
msgstr "Нет ручки"

#. ~ Description of fault "Chipping handle"
#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
