msgstr "Откололись небольшие кусочки ручки."

#. ~ Description of fault "Broken handle"
#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
msgid "The handle is completely broken."
msgstr "Ручка полностью сломана."

#. ~ Description of fault "Broken handle"
#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
