msgstr ""

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "COLLAPSE_CONTENTS"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Contents are hidden by default in inventory view."
msgstr "Содержимое по умолчанию скрыто при просмотре инвентаря."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BIONIC_FUEL_SOURCE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Contents of this item are used for fueling bionics."
msgstr "Содержимое этого предмета используется для питания бионики."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "OVERHEATS"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"Continuously firing this weapon will cause it to <bad>overheat</bad> and "
"<info>can potentially damage it</info>."
msgstr ""
"Непрерывная стрельба из этого оружия приведет к его <bad>перегреву</bad> и "
"<info>потенциально может повредить его</info>."

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "BARRICADABLE_DOOR_DAMAGED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Damaged Barricadable Door"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "BARRICADABLE_DOOR_REINFORCED_DAMAGED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Damaged Barricadable Reinforced Door"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "DIGGABLE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Diggable"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "PIT_FILLABLE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Fillable pit"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "FLAT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Flat"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "COOP_CARD"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Gives you access to the artisans workshop."
msgstr "Даёт вам доступ к верстаку ремесленников."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "DECAY_EXPOSED_ATMOSPHERE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "If exposed to the atmosphere, it will <bad>start to go bad</bad>."
msgstr "При контакте с атмосферой, <bad>начнёт портиться</bad>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "MUTAGEN_CATALYST"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Injecting it will <neutral>jumpstart mutation</neutral>."
msgstr "Инъекция этого <neutral>подталкивает мутацию</neutral>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "MUTAGEN_PRIMER"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Injecting it will <neutral>prime your body for mutation</neutral>."
msgstr "Инъекция этого <neutral>подготовит ваше тело к мутации.</neutral>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SEMITANGIBLE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"It seems <info>partially intangible</info>, and can occupy the same space as "
"other things when worn."
msgstr ""
"Этот предмет <info>частично нематериальный</info> и при ношении может "
"занимать одно и то же место с другими предметами."

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "SHEATH_SPEAR"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must attach to a spear strap"
msgstr "Предмет может поместиться в перевязь для копья"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "MAG_BULKY"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be a bulky magazine"
msgstr "Предмет должен быть громоздким магазином"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "MAG_COMPACT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be a compact magazine"
msgstr "Предмет должен быть компактным магазином"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "GRENADE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be a grenade"
msgstr "Предмет что-то вроде гранаты"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "ABLATIVE_LARGE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be a large ablative plate"
msgstr "Предметом должна быть большая бронепластина"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "ABLATIVE_MEDIUM"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be a medium ablative plate"
msgstr "Предметом должна быть средняя бронепластина"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "ABLATIVE_LARGE_XL"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be an XL ablative plate"
msgstr "Предмет должен быть абляционной пластиной XL"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "BANK_NOTE_SHAPED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be shaped like a bank note"
msgstr "Предмет должен иметь форму банкноты"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "BANK_NOTE_STRAP_SHAPED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be shaped like a bank note strap"
msgstr "Предмет должен иметь форму ремешка для банкнот"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "COIN_SHAPED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be shaped like a coin"
msgstr "Предмет должен иметь форму монеты"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "CREDIT_CARD_SHAPED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be shaped like a credit card"
msgstr "Предмет должен иметь форму кредитной карты"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "PAPER_SHAPED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be shaped like paper"
msgstr "Предмет должен иметь форму бумаги"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "HELMET_BACK_POUCH"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of back pouch"
msgstr "Предмет что-то вроде противовеса для шлема"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "BOOT_FINS_CUSTOM"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of custom fins"
msgstr "Предмет должен быть нестандартными ластами"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "HELMET_EAR_ATTACHMENT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of ear attachment"
msgstr "Предмет что-то вроде приспособления для ушей"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "HELMET_FACE_SHIELD"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of face shield"
msgstr "Предмет что-то вроде лицевого щитка"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "BOOT_FINS"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of fins"
msgstr "Предмет должен быть ластами"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "HELMET_HEAD_ATTACHMENT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of flashlight"
msgstr "Предмет что-то вроде фонарика"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "HELMET_FRONT_ATTACHMENT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of frontal helmet attachment"
msgstr "Предмет должен быть чем-то вроде лобового крепления к шлему"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "WRIST_MOUNT_ATTACHMENT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"Item must be some kind of item that can be attached to a proprietary wrist "
"mount"
msgstr ""
"Здесь может быть предмет, который можно прикрепить на проприетарное "
"крепление на запястье"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "HEAD_STRAP_MOUNT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"Item must be some kind of item that can be attached to straps on masks and "
"hoods"
msgstr ""
"Здесь может быть предмет, который можно прикрепить на ремешки на маски и "
"капюшоны"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "HELMET_NAPE_PROTECTOR"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of nape protector"
msgstr "Предмет что-то вроде защиты задней части шеи"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "HELMET_MANDIBLE_GUARD"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of rail-mounted mandible guard"
msgstr "Предмет что-то вроде отсоединяемого щитка для нижней челюсти"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "EXTRA_PLATING"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of strapped additional plating"
msgstr "Должно быть, речь идет о каком-то дополнительном покрытии с обвязкой"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "HELMET_MANDIBLE_GUARD_STRAPPED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must be some kind of strapped mandible guard"
msgstr "Предмет что-то вроде пристёгиваемого щитка для нижней челюсти"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "BELT_CLIP"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must clip onto a belt loop"
msgstr "Предмет должен быть закреплён в петле ремня"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "SHEATH_BOW"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must fit in a bow sling"
msgstr "Предмет должен поместиться в переноску для лука"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "SHEATH_SWORD"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must fit in a scabbard"
msgstr "Предмет может поместиться в большие ножны"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "SHEATH_KNIFE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must fit in a sheath"
msgstr "Предмет может поместиться в ножны"

#. ~ Description of restriction of JSON flag "SHEATH_AXE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Item must fit in an axe sheath"
msgstr "Предмет может поместиться в ножны для топора"

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "LASER_SIGHT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"Laser sights are invalid when the target position is <bad>too far</bad> or "
"<bad>too bright</bad>."
msgstr ""
"Лазерные прицелы недействительны, если цель находится </bad>слишком далеко</"
"bad> или <bad>слишком яркая</bad>."

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "PHASE_BACK"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Phase back"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "PLOWABLE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Plowable"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "RUBBLE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Rubble"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "EASY_DECONSTRUCT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Simple"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "MC_HAS_DATA"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Some of your data is <info>stored</info> here."
msgstr "Некоторые из ваших данных <info>хранятся</info> здесь."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ITEM_WATERPROOFING"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"Something is preventing your worn and carried items from being effected by "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Что-то препятствует воздействию воды на ваши изношенные и переносимые вещи."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "RAD_STERILIZED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Sterilized using radiation, so it's <good>safe to eat</good>."
msgstr ""
"Стерилизовано с помощью радиации, так что <good>безопасно для еды</good>."

#. ~ Name of JSON flag "SUPPORTS_ROOF"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "Supports roof"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SWIM_UNDER"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"Terrain with this flag is treated as having water beneath a covering (e.g. "
"ice); entities may be considered under water for swimming and related "
"mechanics."
msgstr ""
"Местность с этим флагом рассматривается как имеющая воду под покрытием "
"(например, льдом); объекты можно рассматривать как находящиеся под водой для "
"плавания и связанной с ним механики."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BLEEDSLOW2"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"The character bleeds even slower than normal, losing blood at 1/3rd the "
"normal rate."
msgstr ""
"Персонаж кровоточит ещё медленнее, чем обычно, теряя кровь со скоростью 1/3 "
"от нормальной."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BLEEDSLOW"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"The character bleeds slower than normal, losing blood at 2/3rds the normal "
"rate."
msgstr ""
"Персонаж кровоточит медленнее, чем обычно, теряя кровь со скоростью 2/3 от "
"нормальной."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "VINE_RAPPEL"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "The character can use vines to safely rappel down sheer drops."
msgstr ""
"Персонаж может использовать лозы, чтобы безопасно спуститься по отвесному "
"склону."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ROOTS3"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"The character has extensive roots, which helps with the TREE_COMMUNION "
"mutation."
msgstr "У персонажа обширные корни, что помогает при мутации TREE_COMMUNION."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ROOTS2"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "The character has roots, which helps with the TREE_COMMUNION mutation."
msgstr "У персонажа есть корни, что помогает при мутации TREE_COMMUNION."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "USE_POWER_WHEN_HIT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This armor <info>expends energy when hit</info>."
msgstr "Эта броня <info>расходует энергию при ударе</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CANT_WEAR"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This armor can't be worn directly."
msgstr "Эту броню нельзя носить напрямую."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BIONIC_ARMOR_INTERFACE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This bionic can provide power to powered armor."
msgstr "Эта бионика может обеспечивать энергией силовую броню."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BIONIC_FAULTY"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This bionic is <bad>faulty</bad>."
msgstr "Эта бионика <bad>неисправна</bad>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BIONIC_POWER_SOURCE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This bionic provides power."
msgstr "Эта бионика производит энергию."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "RAD_PROOF"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing <good>completely protects</good> you from <info>radiation</"
"info>."
msgstr ""
"Эта одежда <good>полностью защищает</good> вас от <info>радиации</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "RAD_RESIST"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing <good>partially protects</good> you from <info>radiation</"
"info>."
msgstr ""
"Эта одежда <good>частично защищает</good> вас от <info>радиации</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "FLOTATION"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing <info>prevents going underwater</info> including both "
"<good>drowning</good> and <bad>diving</bad>."
msgstr ""
"Эта одежда <info>препятствует нахождению под водой</info>, если вы "
"<good>тонете</good> или <bad>ныряете</bad>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "WATERPROOF"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing <info>won't let water through</info> under any circumstance."
msgstr ""
"Этот предмет одежды <info>не пропускает воду</info>. До тех пор, пока вы не "
"прыгнете в реку или сделаете что-нибудь подобное."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SWIM_GOGGLES"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing allows you to <good>see much further</good> <info>under water</"
"info>."
msgstr ""
"Этот предмет одежды позволяет вам видеть <info>под водой</info> "
"<good>гораздо дальше обычного</good>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "FIN"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing has fins that <good>improve swimming speed</good>, but "
"<bad>reduce movement speed</bad> on land."
msgstr ""
"Это снаряжение имеет перепонки для плавания, что <good>повышает скорость "
"плавания</good>, но <bad>снижает скорость</bad> на земле."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "FANCY"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This clothing is <info>fancy</info>."
msgstr "Этот предмет одежды <info>модный</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SUPER_FANCY"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This clothing is <info>very fancy</info>."
msgstr "Этот предмет одежды <info>очень модный</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "UNRESTRICTED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This clothing is able to <info>accommodate even mutated anatomy</info>."
msgstr ""
"Эта одежда способна <info>приспособиться даже к мутированной анатомии</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "OVERSIZE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing is large enough to accommodate <info>abnormally large mutated "
"anatomy</info>."
msgstr ""
"Этот предмет одежды достаточно большой, чтобы носить при любых "
"<info>ненормально больших мутациях тела</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SKINTIGHT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This clothing is worn <info>close to the skin</info>."
msgstr "Эту одежду носят <info>прилегая к коже</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SUN_SHADE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing keeps the <info>glare</info> out of your eyes without "
"especially hindering your night vision."
msgstr "Этот предмет одежды защищает ваши глаза от <info>бликов</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SUN_GLASSES"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing keeps the <info>glare</info> out of your eyes, but will hinder "
"your night vision."
msgstr "Этот предмет одежды защищает ваши глаза от <info>бликов</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "STURDY"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing will <good>protect</good> you from harm and withstand <info>a "
"lot of abuse</info>."
msgstr ""
"Этот предмет одежды предназначен для <good>защиты</good> и может выдержать "
"<info>много повреждений</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "COLLAR"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing will be pulled up to <info>keep your face warm</info> if it is "
"unencumbered."
msgstr ""
"Эта одежда с <info>высоким воротником</info> согревает ваш рот, если он не "
"обременён."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "HOOD"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing will be pulled up to <info>keep your head warm</info> if it is "
"unencumbered."
msgstr ""
"Эта одежда с <info>капюшоном</info> согревает голову, если она не обременена."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ALLOWS_NATURAL_ATTACKS"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This clothing won't hinder special attacks that involve <info>mutated or "
"cybernetic anatomy</info>."
msgstr ""
"Эта одежда не помешает особым атакам, которые включают <info>мутировавшую "
"или кибернетическую анатомию</info>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BATTERY_LIGHT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This fits in items that use dry cell batteries."
msgstr "Этот предмет может вмещать предметы, использующие тяжёлые батареи."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BATTERY_MEDIUM"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This fits in items that use lithium batteries."
msgstr "Этот предмет может вмещать предметы, использующие лёгкие батареи."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BATTERY_HEAVY"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This fits in items that use tool batteries."
msgstr "Этот предмет может вмещать предметы, использующие лёгкие батареи."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BATTERY_ULTRA_LIGHT"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This fits in items that use watch batteries."
msgstr "Этот предмет может вмещать предметы, использующие тяжёлые батареи."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "MELTS"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This food <neutral>melts when not in a very cold climate</neutral>, and "
"tastes much <good>better</good> when <color_light_cyan>frozen</color>."
msgstr ""
"Эта пища </neutral>растаёт в тепле </neutral>, и на вкус намного "
"<good>лучше</good>, когда <color_light_cyan>заморожена</color>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BAD_TASTE"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This food is <bad>unappetizing</bad> in a way that <bad>can't be covered up "
"by most cooking</bad>."
msgstr ""
"Эта еда <bad>неаппетитна</bad> настолько, что <bad>ее приготовление не "
"исправит этого</bad>."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "RAW"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This food is <info>raw</info>, and will be <good>more nutritious</good> if "
"cooked."
msgstr ""
"Эта еда <info>сырая</info>, и будет <good>более питательной</good>, если ее "
"приготовить."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "IRRADIATED"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid "This food item has been irradiated, and will spoil 4 times slower."
msgstr "Этот продукт облучён и будет портиться в 4 раза медленнее."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "DEAF"
