msgstr "Инструмент для измерения напряжения."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "WORN_WEAPON"
#: data/json/flags/flags.json
msgid ""
"This weapon <info>must be worn</info> in order to make proper use of it."
