#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "white grass"
msgstr "белая трава"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "willow tree"
msgstr "ива"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "woodchips"
msgstr "опилки"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "young bamboo shoots"
msgstr "молодые побеги бамбука"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal mound"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "A mound of fungal matter, intertwined in itself."
msgstr "Холмик переплетённой грибной материи."

#. ~ Description of terrain "young fungal tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "A small sapling poking through the ground, infested by fungal mold."
msgstr ""
"Маленький выбивающийся из-под земли росточек, заражённый грибной плесенью."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "Fungus grows thick here, obscuring the ground beneath it."
msgstr "Плотные грибковые заросли, скрывающие землю."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"Grayish mold coats both the floor and the roof here, silent and still.  "
"Stray spores waft through the air."
msgstr ""
"Крыша и пол, покрытые неподвижной серой плесенью. Несколько спор колышутся в "
"воздухе."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "Grayish mold coats the floor here, silent and still."
msgstr "Пол, покрытый неподвижной серой плесенью."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "Grayish mold coats the ground here, silent and still."
msgstr "Земля, покрытая неподвижной серой плесенью."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "Marloss bush"
msgstr "куст марло"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "Marloss tree"
msgstr "дерево марло"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"Once tall and majestic, this tree is now a slave to the fungus like the "
"landscape around it.  Its bark is penetrated by and covered with fungal "
"tendrils, and the canopy has rotted away, leaving only the branches, "
"stretching forlornly to the sky as if to escape the infection overrunning it."
msgstr ""
"Когда-то гордое и высокое дерево стало рабом грибка, как и вся местность "
"вокруг. Его кору пронизывают и покрывают грибные ростки. Крона прогнила и "
"отвалилась, остались только ветки, горестно тянущиеся к небу, будто в "
"попытке спастись от поглощающей инфекции."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"Several thick, large tendrils of fungus perforate the wall here, piercing "
"straight through it from the outside.  Despite the apparent damage, the wall "
"is still structurally sound."
msgstr ""
"Эта стена насквозь пронизана большими толстыми грибными ростками. Несмотря "
"на повреждения, стена ещё держится."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"The fungus here has grown thickly and tightly enough to form a solid wall.  "
"It feels very stiff to the touch, and seems to be very strong."
msgstr ""
"Толстые плотно переплетённые грибные ростки, образовавшие сплошную стену. "
"Она очень жёсткая на ощупь и кажется очень прочной."

#. ~ Description of terrain "Marloss bush"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"This alien plant superficially resembles a blueberry bush, and hangs with "
"large, juicy pink pomes that emit a heady, fruity aroma."
msgstr ""
"Это иноземное растение внешне напоминает черничный куст. С его ветвей "
"свисают большие сочные розовые плоды с пьянящим фруктовым запахом."

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal shrub"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"This shrub has been completely absorbed by the mushrooms.  Its branches "
"droop and have lost much of their structure, and its leaves have vanished, "
"replaced by fleshy gray sacks that visibly expand and contract."
msgstr ""
"Грибы полностью поглотили этот куст. Его поникшие ветки потеряли почти всю "
"форму. Листьев больше нет, вместо них растут мясистые серые мешочки, которые "
"заметно расширяются и сокращаются."

#. ~ Description of terrain "Marloss tree"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"This tree stands as a stark outlier to the landscape around it.  Despite its "
"infestation, its leaves wave proudly in the wind, colored pinkish-white.  "
"Its branches are heavy with pink fruit that looks both mutated and delicious."
msgstr ""
"Это дерево резко выделяется на окружающей местности. Несмотря на заражение, "
"его бело-розовые листья гордо колышутся на ветру. Ветви гнутся под тяжестью "
"розовых плодов, мутировавших и восхитительных на вид."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal bed"
msgstr "грибное ложе"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal floor"
msgstr "грибной пол"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal mound"
msgstr "грибной холмик"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal shrub"
msgstr "грибной куст"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal tree"
msgstr "грибное дерево"

