#. ~ Description of terrain "broken wattle-and-daub wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid ""
"A wattle-and-daub wall section that has been destroyed, leaving mostly just "
"the frame, and even that is barely held together."
msgstr ""
"Разрушенная стена из мазанки. Осталась только рама, которая едва держится "
"вместе."

#. ~ Description of terrain "black wood wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "A wooden wall, painted black."
msgstr "Деревянная стена, окрашенная в чёрный."

#. ~ Description of terrain "blue wood wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
