#. ~ Description of terrain "rope leading up"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid ""
"A dangling end of rope, the other end tied securely to something above you.  "
"You could climb up it."
msgstr ""
"Свисающая верёвка, крепко прицепленная к чему-то сверху. Вы можете подняться "
"наверх или снять её."

#. ~ Description of terrain "downward slope"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A downward-facing slope."
msgstr "Уклон, ведущий вниз."

#. ~ Description of terrain "stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A flight of stairs leading down."
msgstr "Лестничный пролёт, ведущий вниз."

#. ~ Description of terrain "stairs"
#. ~ Description of terrain "low stairs (beginning section)"
#. ~ Description of terrain "low stairs (end section)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A flight of stairs leading up."
msgstr "Лестничный пролёт, ведущий вверх."

#. ~ Description of terrain "manhole cover"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid ""
"A heavy iron manhole cover, zealously blocking the entrance to a sewer or "
"other underground area.  Impossible to lift by hand, you'll need some kind "
"of heavy-duty prying tool."
msgstr ""
"Тяжёлая железная крышка люка, рьяно загораживающая вход в канализацию или "
"другое подземное помещение. Вручную поднять невозможно, понадобится какой-"
"нибудь тяжёлый инструмент для выламывания."

#. ~ Description of terrain "ladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A ladder leading down."
msgstr "Лестница вниз."

#. ~ Description of terrain "ladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A ladder leading up and down."
msgstr "Лестница вверх и вниз."

#. ~ Description of terrain "ladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A ladder leading up."
msgstr "Лестница вверх."

#. ~ Description of terrain "manhole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid ""
"A manhole.  The heavy iron cover has been removed, revealing an entrance to "
"the underworld of hidden tunnels beneath the streets where sewage and "
"rainwater frolic freely.  Or maybe it just leads to a lower floor."
msgstr ""
"Люк. Тяжёлая железная крышка была снята, открыв вход в подземный мир скрытых "
"туннелей под улицами, где свободно резвятся сточные воды и дождевая вода. "
"Или, может быть, это просто ведет на нижний этаж."

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid ""
"A number of planks are missing and the structure is beginning to sag and "
"fall apart.  It's going to need quite a bit of work to repair this staircase."
msgstr ""
"Нескольких досок не хватает, вся конструкция начинает проседать и "
"разваливаться. Для ремонта этой лестницы потребуется немалая работа."

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A wooden staircase leading down."
msgstr "Деревянные ступеньки, ведущие вниз."

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A wooden staircase leading up"
msgstr "Деревянные ступеньки, ведущие наверх."

#. ~ Description of terrain "upward slope"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "An upward-facing slope."
msgstr "Уклон, ведущий вверх."

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid ""
"Half of a wooden staircase.  Some work still needs to be done before this "
"staircase is complete."
msgstr ""
"Половина деревянной лестницы. Нужно ещё поработать, чтобы закончить лестницу."

#. ~ Description of terrain "scaffolding down"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "Scaffolding leading down."
msgstr "Леса ведущие вниз."

#. ~ Description of terrain "scaffolding up/down"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "Scaffolding leading up and down."
msgstr "Леса ведущие вверх и вниз."

#. ~ Description of terrain "scaffolding up"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "Scaffolding leading up."
msgstr "Строительные леса, ведущие вверх."

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete ramp down (low end)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "The lower end of a concrete ramp leading down."
msgstr "Нижняя часть бетонного съезда, ведущего вниз."

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete ramp up (low end)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "The lower end of a concrete ramp leading up."
msgstr "Нижняя часть бетонной рампы, ведущей вверх."

#. ~ Description of terrain "railroad ramp down (low end)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "The lower end of a railroad ramp leading down."
msgstr "Нижняя часть железнодорожной рампы, ведущей вниз."

#. ~ Description of terrain "railroad ramp up (low end)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "The lower end of a railroad ramp leading up."
msgstr "Нижняя часть железнодорожной рампы, ведущей вверх."

#. ~ Description of terrain "sidewalk ramp down (low end)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "The lower end of a sidewalk ramp leading down."
