".500 S&W Magnum ammunition with a 500gr bullet.  The .500 S&W Magnum round "
"is a colossally powerful handgun cartridge capable of killing almost any "
"target with one hit.  It has extremely high damage, and recoil to match."
msgstr ""
"Патрон калибра .500 S&W Magnum с 500-грановой пулей. Это пистолетный патрон "
