#. ~ Description of "survivor firehood"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_headgear.json
msgid ""
"A custom padded hood with Nomex facing to resist fire and chemical attacks."
msgstr ""
"Специальный мягкий капюшон с облицовкой из номекса для защиты от огня и "
"химического воздействия."

#. ~ Description of "survivor hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_headgear.json
msgid ""
"A custom waterproof hood lined with kevlar and leather padding, it offers a "
"comfortable layer of protection for the head."
msgstr ""
"Специальный водонепроницаемый капюшон с кевларовой и кожаной подкладкой "
"обеспечивает комфортную защиту головы."

#. ~ Description of "winter survivor hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_headgear.json
msgid ""
"A custom waterproof hood lined with kevlar and leather padding, it offers a "
"comfortable layer of protection for the head.  It's very warm thanks to its "
"fur lining"
msgstr ""
"Специальный водонепроницаемый капюшон с кевларовой и кожаной подкладкой "
"обеспечивает комфортную защиту головы.  Очень тепло благодаря меховой "
"подкладке."

#. ~ Description of "faux fur winter survivor hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_headgear.json
msgid ""
"A customized armored hood, chemical-resistant and padded with Kevlar.  It's "
"also warm thanks to the faux fur lining."
msgstr ""
