#. ~ Description of "saddle bags"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of covered pouches laid across the back of a horse behind the saddle."
msgstr ""
"Пара закрываемых сумок с возможностью крепления на спине лошади за седлом."

#. ~ Description of "horse rain sheet"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
