"It contains The Upanishads, part 2/2: Katha Upanishad, Mundaka Upanishad, "
"Taittiriya Upanishad, Brhadaranyaka Upanishad, Svetasvatara Upanishad, "
"Prasna Upanishad and Maitrayani Upanishad."
