#. ~ Description of "50 gallon aquarium (drying)"
#. ~ Description of "50 gallon aquarium (drying) (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"A 50-gallon glass aquarium, used for safely storing small animals for use as "
"pets or food.  This one has been freshly made and requires time for the "
