#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M199 casing"
#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid ""
"A large casing from a spent 40x46mm cartridge, which used to hold a buckshot "
"load.  Suitable for reloading with buckshot, slug or flechette loads."
