#. ~ Description of gun "XM-P plasma rifle"
#. ~ Description of "XM-P plasma rifle"
#: data/json/items/ranged/energy.json
msgid ""
"A prototype weapon which uses a pulsed laser to charge the air between "
"itself and the target, then delivers a packet of ionized gas along the "
"resulting current, which explodes on impact to set targets alight and play "
"havoc with electronics."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/ranged/energy.json
