#. ~ Description of gun "PPA-5 plasma launcher"
#. ~ Description of "PPA-5 plasma launcher"
#: data/json/items/ranged/energy.json
msgid ""
"The Portable Plasma Accelerator Model Five, as its digital display proudly "
"calls it, is a prototype weapon which uses a pulsed laser to give the air "
"between itself and its target an electrical charge, then uses that brief "
"moment of conductivity to deliver a payload of ionized gas that explodes in "
"a brilliant and incredibly hot display on impact.  It's a bit like if a "
"rocket launcher fired lightning bolts made out of that blue fire that you "
"see when you microwave things you're not supposed to."
msgstr ""

