msgstr ""
"Вы можете использовать это для смягчения последствий кровопотери. Требуется "
"навык медицины 4."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "SALINE_INFUSION_250" in use action of item "small saline infusion kit"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "SALINE_INFUSION_500" in use action of item "saline infusion kit"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "SALINE_INFUSION_1000" in use action of item "large saline infusion kit"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "SALINE_INFUSION_2000" in use action of item "huge saline infusion kit"
