#. ~ Description of "outdoor trash bin"
#: data/json/items/tool/unfoldable.json
msgid ""
"A big plastic trash can with two wheels and a lid.  This one is tipped over, "
"activate it to set it up for rolling."
msgstr "Большой пластиковый мусорный бак с двумя колесами и крышкой."

#. ~ Description of "folded Bicycle"
#: data/json/items/tool/unfoldable.json
