#. ~ Description of "off-road bicycle wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A bicycle wheel intended for off-road biking.  Its tread is deeply grooved "
"to better endure offroad conditions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bicycle wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A bicycle wheel."
msgstr "Велосипедное колесо."

#. ~ Description of "deflated bicycle wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A bicycle wheel.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to "
"be used on a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Колесо велосипеда. В настоящее время оно спущено, и его необходимо будет "
"надуть, чтобы использовать на транспорте."

#. ~ Description of "racing tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A car tire for fitting to a medium steel rim.  Its smooth surface is "
"terrible offroad, but on dry pavement it can outperform other types of tire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A car wheel, deeply grooved to better endure offroad conditions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A car wheel."
msgstr "Автомобильное колесо."

#. ~ Description of "deflated wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A car wheel.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be "
"used on a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Колесо автомобиля. Оно спущено, и его необходимо будет надуть, чтобы "
"использовать на транспорте."

#. ~ Description of "banded wooden cart wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A handmade wooden cart wheel with metal bands for durability."
msgstr ""
"Самодельное деревянное колесо от телеги с металлическими полосами для "
"долговечности."

#. ~ Description of "wooden cart wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A handmade wooden cart wheel."
msgstr "Самодельное деревянное колесо от телеги."

#. ~ Description of "heavy wheel hub assembly"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A heavy metal assembly that allows bolting a wheel onto a car.  Fit for a "
"large car wheel."
msgstr ""
"Тяжёлая металлическая конструкция, позволяющая закрепить колесо на "
"автомобиле. Подходит для большого автомобильного колеса."

#. ~ Description of "roller drum"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "roller drum"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A large cylinder fashioned out of plates of hardened steel, normally found "
"on road rollers.  Its massive weight is meant to, slowly, roll over asphalt "
"and other surfaces, levelling them out."
msgstr ""
"Большой цилиндр, изготовленный из пластин закаленной стали, обычно "
"встречается на дорожных катках.  Его огромный вес предназначен для того, "
"чтобы медленно катиться по асфальту и другим поверхностям, выравнивая их."

#. ~ Description of "bicycle rim"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A large, spoked rim for a bicycle tire."
msgstr "Большой обод со спицами для велосипедной шины."

#. ~ Description of "medium steel rim"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A medium-size steel rim for a car tire."
msgstr "Стальной обод среднего размера для автомобильной шины."

#. ~ Description of "medium wheel hub assembly"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A metal assembly that allows bolting a wheel onto a car.  Fit for a car "
"wheel."
msgstr ""
"Металлическая конструкция, позволяющая закрепить колесо на автомобиле. "
"Подходит для автомобильного колеса."

#. ~ Description of "motorbike tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A motorbike tire for fitting to a steel motorbike rim."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "off-road motorbike wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A motorbike wheel, deeply grooved to better endure offroad conditions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "deflated off-road motorbike wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A motorbike wheel, studded for improved off-road performance.  It is "
"currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Колесо мотоцикла с шипами для повышенной проходимости. В настоящее время оно "
"спущено, и его необходимо будет надуть, чтобы использовать на транспорте."

#. ~ Description of "motorbike wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A motorbike wheel."
msgstr "Колесо от мотоцикла."

#. ~ Description of "deflated motorbike wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A motorbike wheel.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to "
"be used on a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Колесо мотоцикла. В настоящее время оно спущено, и его необходимо будет "
"надуть, чтобы использовать на транспорте."

#. ~ Description of "skateboard trucks"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A pair metal skateboard trucks, for attaching wheels to."
msgstr "Две металлических подвески для скейтборда, к которым крепятся колеса."

#. ~ Description of "pair of small rail wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A pair of small rail wheels.  It fits small railroad rails found in places "
"like amusement parks.  Mostly for hobby purposes rather than transportation."
msgstr ""
"Пара маленьких железнодорожных колёс. Они подходят для небольших рельс, "
"например, как в парках развлечений. Лучше подойдут для развлечения, чем для "
"настоящего транспорта."

#. ~ Description of "wheelchair wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A pair of wheels for a wheelchair."
msgstr "Пара колёс для инвалидного кресла."

#. ~ Description of "light wheel mount"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "light wheel mount"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A piece of metal with holes suitable for a bike or motorbike wheel."
msgstr ""
"Кусок металла с отверстиями для велосипедного или мотоциклетного колеса."

#. ~ Description of "wooden wheel mount"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A piece of wood with holes suitable for a bike wheel."
msgstr "Кусок дерева с отверстиями для велосипедного колеса."

#. ~ Description of "small wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A pretty small wheel.  Probably from one of those Segway things.  It is not "
"very menacing."
msgstr ""
"Довольно маленькое колесо. Вероятно, от одного из сегвеев. Выглядит не "
"слишком угрожающе."

#. ~ Description of "set of skateboard wheels"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "skateboard wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A set of four small wheels, for a skateboard."
msgstr "Набор из четырех маленьких коёесиков для скейтборда."

#. ~ Description of "set of tricycle wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A set of hard plastic wheels with one larger than the other two.  Proudly "
"made in the USA by Double Dango Productions."
msgstr ""
"Три жёстких пластмассовых колеса, одно большое и два поменьше. С гордостью "
"изготовлено «Дабл Данго Продакшнс» в США."

#. ~ Description of "set of medium casters"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "medium casters"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A set of medium wheels mounted on pivots, like you'd find on a shopping cart."
msgstr "Набор колёсиков, как на магазинной тележке."

#. ~ Description of "set of small casters"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small casters"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A set of small wheels mounted on pivots, like you'd find on a rolling office "
"chair."
msgstr ""
"Комплект маленьких колес на вращающихся шарнирах. Такие обычно используются "
"на офисных креслах и тележках для покупок."

#. ~ Description of "concrete mixer wheel mounts"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "concrete mixer wheel mounts"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A set of two small wheel mounts from a concrete mixer."
msgstr "Набор из двух небольших колесных креплений от бетономешалки."

#. ~ Description of "concrete mixer wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A set of two small wheels from a concrete mixer."
msgstr "Комплект из двух небольших колес от бетономешалки."

#. ~ Description of "set of large casters"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A set of wheels mounted on pivots, like you'd find a dumpster or a generator."
msgstr ""
"Комплект маленьких колес на вращающихся шарнирах. Такие обычно используются "
"на офисных креслах и тележках для покупок."

#. ~ Description of "metal wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A simple metal wheel."
msgstr "Простое металлическое колесо."

#. ~ Description of "wheelbarrow wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A small wheel from a common garden wheelbarrow."
msgstr "Маленькое колесо от обычной садовой тачки."

#. ~ Description of "car tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A standard car tire for fitting to a medium steel rim."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "steel motorbike rim"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A steel rim for a motorbike tire."
msgstr "Стальной обод для мотоциклетной шины."

#. ~ Description of "rail wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A strong rail wheel.  A flange helps keep it on a rail, but makes it perform "
"terribly when not on a rail."
msgstr ""
"Крепкое железнодорожное колесо. Из-за выступа прочно держится на рельсе, но "
"ужасно на всём остальном."

#. ~ Description of "skate wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A very small plastic wheel with a punk attitude.  This wheel was made for "
"skating."
msgstr ""
"Очень маленькое пластиковое колесо розового цвета. Изготовлено для установки "
"на скейт."

#. ~ Description of "armored wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide military-grade wheel."
msgstr "Широкое колесо военного образца."

#. ~ Description of "wide steel rim"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide steel rim for a larger tire."
msgstr "Широкий стальной обод для крупных шин."

#. ~ Description of "wide tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide tire for fitting to a wide steel rim."
msgstr "Широкая шина, подходящая широкому стальному ободу."

#. ~ Description of "off-road wide tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A wide tire for fitting to a wide steel rim.  It's studded to provide better "
"grip off-road at the cost of some performance on pavement."
msgstr ""
"Широкая шина.для широкого стального обода. Шипованное покрытие обеспечивает "
"хорошее сцепление на бездорожье, несколько замедляя скорость на асфальте."

#. ~ Description of "deflated off-road wide wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A wide wheel with deeply grooved tread to endure off-road conditions at the "
"cost of some performance on pavement.  It is currently deflated and will "
"need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wide wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "A wide wheel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "deflated wide wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A wide wheel.  It is currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be "
"used on a vehicle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "off-road wide wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A wide wheel.  It's studded to provide better grip off-road at the cost of "
"some performance on pavement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "deflated racing wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A wide, smooth wheel intended for racing.  It is currently deflated and will "
"need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Широкое и гладкое колесо автомобиля для гонок. В настоящее время оно "
"спущено, и его необходимо будет надуть, чтобы использовать на транспорте."

#. ~ Description of "racing wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A wide, smooth wheel intended for racing.  The slick surface provides better "
"speed on pavement but penalizes off-road speed."
msgstr ""
"Широкое ровное колесо для гоночных машин. Благодаря гладкой поверхности "
"увеличивает скорость на асфальте и уменьшает на бездорожье."

#. ~ Description of "off-road bicycle tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A wide, studded bicycle tire intended to be fitted to a bicycle rim for off-"
"road biking."
msgstr ""
"Широкая шипованная велосипедная шина для езды по бездорожью, подходящая на "
"велосипедный обод."

#. ~ Description of "deflated off-road bicycle wheel"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A wide, studded, bicycle wheel intended for off-road biking.  It is "
"currently deflated and will need to be inflated to be used on a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Широкое колесо велосипеда с шипами для езды по бездорожью. В настоящее время "
"оно спущено, и его необходимо будет надуть, чтобы использовать на транспорте."

#. ~ Description of "off-road motorbike tire"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid "An off-road motorbike tire for fitting to a steel motorbike rim."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small wheels"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/wheel.json
msgid ""
"Two small plastic wheels snapped onto a simple wire axle, the kind you'd see "
"on a child's wagon or a rolling trash can."
msgstr ""
"Два маленьких пластиковых колеса защелкнулись на простой проволочной оси, "
"такой можно увидеть на детской коляске или катящемся мусорном баке."

