msgstr "Место для мутагенов, сывороток и пурификаторов."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Other"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for other miscellaneous items."
msgstr "Место для прочих вещей."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Perishable Food"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"Destination for perishable comestibles.  Does include perishable drinks if "
