msgstr "Тело (%s) растворяется в кислоте."

#. ~ Death message of monster "small slime"
#. ~ Death message of monster "tadpole constrictor"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body melts away."
msgstr "Тело (%s) тает."

#. ~ Description of monster "sewer slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"This moving, black glob emits a foul stench that indicates that it has "
"incorporated a great deal of sewage into itself."
msgstr ""

