#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
msgid "Don't leave me hanging, what happened next?"
msgstr "Ну не тяни, что же было дальше?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
