msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Woof, you ready for a real hot take?  The <swear> government did this to "
"us.  Intentionally, or at least sort-of intentionally."
msgstr ""
"Фуф, ты готова к реально горячим новостям? Это, <swear>, правительство с "
"нами сделало. Намеренно, по крайней мере отчасти."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
