"Я был на дежурстве в участке, когда всё покатилось к чёрту. Никто из "
"остальных полицейских не вернулся с последнего вызова, ну, точнее, не "
"вернулся человеком…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was watching the station when things went sideways.  None of the other "
"officers returned from the last call, well not as humans anyway…"
msgstr ""
"Было моё дежурство в участке, когда что-то пошло не так. Никто из остальных "
"полицейских не вернулся с последнего вызова, точнее, не вернулся человеком…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I gotta go."
msgstr "Прости, мне надо идти."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid ""
"Knives… drugs… um… drugs and shiny things.  Thieves steal all sorts of stuff."
msgstr ""
"Ножики… Наркотики… Э… Наркотики и блестяшки. Воры крали всякую всячину."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Let's trade items."
msgstr "Давай обменяемся предметами."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_quartermaster.json
msgid "Let's trade then."
msgstr "Тогда давай поторгуем."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"STOP, Put your hands in the air!  Ha, startled you didn't I… there is no law "
"anymore…"
msgstr "СТОЯТЬ, руки вверх! Ха, я тебя напугала, да? Закона больше нет…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"STOP, Put your hands in the air!  Ha, startled you didn't I… there is no law "
"anymore…"
msgstr "СТОЯТЬ, руки вверх! Ха, я тебя напугал, да? Закона больше нет…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"STOP, Put your hands in the air!  Ha, startled you didn't I… there is no law "
"anymore…"
msgstr "СТОЯТЬ, руки вверх! Ха, страшно, да? Закона больше нет…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"This is a nice, secure building.  I'd be a fool to leave.  Been living off "
"the vending machines, but I found the code for the evidence lockup so I've "
"been doing some trading with other survivors."
msgstr ""
"Это отличное и защищённое здание. Было бы глупо уйти отюда. Одно время мне "
"приходилось питаться из торговых автоматов, но потом я нашла код к хранилищу "
"вещдоков и теперь я торгую с выжившими."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"This is a nice, secure building.  I'd be a fool to leave.  Been living off "
"the vending machines, but I found the code for the evidence lockup so I've "
"been doing some trading with other survivors."
msgstr ""
"Это отличное и защищённое здание. Было бы глупо уйти отюда. Одно время мне "
"приходилось питаться из торговых автоматов, но потом я нашёл код к хранилищу "
"вещдоков и теперь я торгую с выжившими."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
