msgid ""
"This is a nice, secure building.  I'd be a fool to leave.  Been living off "
"the vending machines, but I found the code for the evidence lockup so I've "
"been doing some trading with other survivors."
msgstr ""
"Это отличное и защищённое здание. Было бы глупо уйти отюда. Одно время "
"приходилось питаться из торговых автоматов, но потом мне попался код к "
"хранилищу вещдоков и теперь я торгую с выжившими."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Wanna get outta here?"
msgstr "Хочешь выбраться отсюда?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid "Well, let me check out some of that stuff."
msgstr "Что ж, дай посмотреть на эту всячину."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
#: data/json/npcs/mine/spiral_madman.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Чем ты здесь занимаешься?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid "What can you sell me?"
msgstr "Что ты продаёшь?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid "What kind of stuff was in the evidence lockup?"
msgstr "Что было в хранилище?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Why don't you go somewhere else?"
msgstr "Почему тебе не уйти куда-нибудь ещё?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, there are some like me that have holed up around town.  We do some "
"trading… and then sometimes a stranger wanders through thinking they'll find "
"something better here than they left behind."
msgstr ""
"Ага, есть такие как я, что укрываются в городе. Мы немного торгуем… Иногда "
"приходит странник, уверенный, что найдёт лучшую долю здесь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid "You've seen other survivors?"
msgstr "Здесь были другие выжившие?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "*buzz* Great!  So what happens now?"
msgstr "*жжж* Отлично! И что будет дальше?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"Big fucking deal.  Do what I say or I'll shove that chip back where it "
"belongs."
msgstr "Ну охуеть теперь. Делай, что я скажу, или я запихну тот чип обратно."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Come with me.  We can help each other out."
msgstr "Пойдём со мной. Мы оба выиграем от этого."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Follow me and do my bidding, then."
msgstr "Тогда иди за мной и выполняй мои приказы."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"For all you know, I did.  I'm being nice for now.  You'd better hope that it "
"lasts."
msgstr ""
"С того, что я для тебя делаю. Пока что я отношусь к тебе по-хорошему. "
"Надейся, что так оно и будет впредь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Forget it.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "Забудь. Наслаждайся свободой."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Get out of my sight."
msgstr "Свали прочь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Hey.  Let's chat for a second."
msgstr "Эй, давай немного поболтаем."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"I wouldn't have pulled your chip out if I didn't want you to think for "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Зачем бы мне вытаскивать твой чип, если бы мне не хотелось освободить тебя?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "I'm sorry!  I shouldn't have said that!"
msgstr "Прости! Мне не стоило так говорить!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I… I'm free.  *Zzzt* I'm actually free!  *bzzz* Look, you're the first "
"person I've seen in a long time."
msgstr ""
"Я… Я свободна… *жжжт* Я и вправду свободна! *бжжж* Эй, а ты первый человек, "
"которого я вижу за долгое время."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I… I'm free.  *Zzzt* I'm actually free!  *bzzz* Look, you're the first "
"person I've seen in a long time."
msgstr ""
"Я… Я свободен… *жжжт* Я и вправду свободен! *бжжж* Эй, а ты первый человек, "
"которого я вижу за долгое время."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I… I'm free.  *Zzzt* I'm actually free!  *bzzz* Look, you're the first "
"person I've seen in a long time."
msgstr ""
"Свобода… *жжжт* Свобода! *бжжж* Слушай, ты первый человек, которого я вижу "
"за долгое время."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "No, *I'm* sorry, I didn't mean that.  Go do what you want."
msgstr ""
"Нет, это ты прости, мне не хотелось тебя обидеть. Иди, делай что хочешь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Not if I kill you first!"
msgstr "Только если я не убью тебя первее!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, *BUZZ* I'm sorry!  Don't hurt me again!  Anything but the chip!"
msgstr ""
"Ладно, ладно, *ЖЖЖ* прости! Не делай мне больно! Что угодно, только не чип!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Run while you still can!"
msgstr "Беги пока можешь!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Sorry, I'm nobody.  Enjoy your freedom, I guess."
msgstr "Прости, я никто. Наслаждайся свободой, наверно."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "Как знаешь."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "That's because I saved you.  Listen, I could use your help…"
msgstr ""
"Это потому, что я твой спаситель. Слушай, мне б не помешала твоя помощь…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "We both go our separate ways.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "Наши пути расходятся. Наслаждайся свободой."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Yeah, *beeeeep* I don't think so.  Bye."
msgstr "Ага, *биииииип* я так не думаю. Пока."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"…Wait.  *BEEP* Why do I believe you?  *ZZZT* You could be just as bad as "
"them!"
msgstr ""
"…Погоди. *БИИП*. С чего бы мне верить тебе? *ЗЗЗТ* Ты может, такой же "
"ужасный человек как и они!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "…kill… *ZTZTZT* …you!"
msgstr "…убью… *ЗЖЗЖЗЖЗ* …тебя!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "Справедливо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Forget it.  Let's go."
msgstr "Забудь. Пошли."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I have some orders to give."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "I want you to start a settlement here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"Most work is designated via zones or crafting orders, but you can designate "
"a settlement and build a bulletin board or speak with me directly to handle "
"a few types of offsite missions where I or another follower will head out to "
"do some task without your supervision."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Never mind, let's go back to talking about settlements."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Never mind, let's talk about other things you can do."
msgstr "Забудь, давай поговорим о других делах, которые ты можешь выполнить."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Never mind, let's talk about something else."
msgstr "Неважно, давай поговорим о чём-нибудь ещё."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Nothing.  Let's get back to work."
msgstr "Ничего. Давай вернёмся к работе."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Nothing.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "Ничего. Давай поговорим о чем-нибудь ещё."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me about missions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me how settlements work."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "We need to abandon this camp."
msgstr "Мы бросаем этот лагерь."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "What about settlements?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"When you assign a companion to an offsite mission, they'll disappear while "
"they go do whatever you want them to do.  When the duration of the mission "
"has elapsed, you'll see a new mission on the bulletin board to have them "
"return and complete the mission by upgrading your settlement, returning "
"their hunting kills, dropping off whatever they were crafting, or whatever "
"else the mission results are.\n"
"  There are all kinds of faction camp missions: building up the camp, "
"recruiting new allies, hunting and trapping game, scrounging for materials, "
"that sort of thing.\n"
"  Assign missions by interacting with the bulletin board or talking to me, "
"in person or over a two-way radio.\n"
"  There is one special mission called 'Emergency Recall'.  You can use this "
"to retrieve any companion on a faction camp mission, but this cancels the "
"mission and wastes any resources used on it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "Alright."
msgstr "Хорошо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Can I join you?"
msgstr "Могу я присоединиться к вам?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid ""
"Dangerous?  It may look different, but this land cares and provides for us.  "
"We are celebrating with a feast, in fact.  Do you care to join us?"
msgstr ""
"Опасно? Оно выглядит иначе, но эта земля заботится о нас и даёт нам пищу. На "
"самом деле мы празднуем, и у нас пир. Хочешь присоединиться?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what kind of heresy you are spreading, but I'm putting an end "
"to it!"
msgstr "Не знаю, что там за ересь ты несёшь, но я положу этому конец!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I have changed my mind, thank you."
msgstr "Всё таки не стоит, спасибо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I'd… rather not."
msgstr "Я… Пожалуй, воздержусь."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Я жрица или, можно сказать, наставница. Я пою гимны со своими товарищами, "
"чтобы научиться жить в единстве и друг с другом, и с нашим захворавшим миром."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Я жрец или, можно сказать, наставник. Я пою гимны со своими товарищами, "
"чтобы научиться жить в единстве и друг с другом, и с нашим захворавшим миром."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Я жрец или, даже, наставник. Я пою гимны вместе со своими товарищами, чтобы "
"учиться жить в единстве и друг с другом, и с нашим захворавшим миром."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I'm joining no stinking cult!  Take your berry and shove it!"
msgstr ""
"Я не собираюсь вступать в сраную секту! Засунь себе эту ягоду куда подальше!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I'm sorry… I have places to be."
msgstr "Прости… Мне надо идти."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Join us then, eat from this meal with us."
msgstr "Тогда иди к нам, отведай с нами эту пищу."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Look for the bonds which define you, and act in accord."
msgstr "Взгляни на связи, что тебя определяют, и действуй в согласии с ними."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "May the earth flourish beneath our paths."
msgstr "Пусть земля цветёт на нашем пути."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "May you find your peace, traveler."
msgstr "Да найдёшь ты мир, странник."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Oh, but you already have."
msgstr "О, но ты уже."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "This place is dangerous, what are you doing here?"
msgstr "Здесь опасно, что ты тут делаешь?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Understood.  Can I join you?"
msgstr "Понятно. Могу я присоединиться к вам?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Unity of spirit, of mind, and body…"
msgstr "Единство духа, разума и тела…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "We might have lost everything, but hope remains."
msgstr "Может, мы и потеряли всё, но у нас осталась надежда."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Well, I gotta go."
msgstr "Что ж, мне пора."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Well, sure."
msgstr "Ну, хорошо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "Кто ты?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Yes, friend?"
msgstr "Да, друг?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Yes… yes I have."
msgstr "Да… Да, я уже."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Your travels be fruitful, friend."
msgstr "Да принесут твои поиски плоды, друг."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "[Take Marloss berry.] Thank you."
msgstr "[Возьмите ягоду Марлосса.] Спасибо."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "A daring trader?  Yes.  Let's trade items."
msgstr "Из храбрых торговцев? Точно. Давай поторгуем."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "Are you all right?"
msgstr "С тобой все в порядке?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "Ты одна из них?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "Ты один из них?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "Ты один из них?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"Come a little closer, I don't want to make too much noise.  You smell much "
"nicer than what I'm used to.  Someone in trouble banged on the door that "
"night, she said she was desperate, she had a baby, her home had burned down "
"and her drugs were gone and there were monsters in the streets.  We figured "
"she was on drugs, but we couldn't turn them away so we gave them food and "
"let them stay in the barn."
msgstr ""
"Подойди поближе, я не хочу шуметь. Ты пахнешь намного приятнее, чем я привык "
"ощущать. Той ночью кто-то постучался в дверь, она сказала, что была в "
"отчаянии, у нее был ребенок, ее дом сгорел, ее наркотики исчезли, и на "
"улицах были монстры. Мы подумали, что она на наркотиках, но мы не могли их "
"прогнать, поэтому мы дали им поесть и позволили им остаться в амбаре."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "Have anything to trade?"
msgstr "Есть что-нибудь на продажу?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgctxt "npc:f u:f"
msgid ""
"Hey, you're alive!  Me too.  Been a long while since I've had a "
"conversation.  Uh, with someone else.  Um."
msgstr ""
"Эй, ты всё ещё живая! Я тоже. Давненько я не разговаривала, эээ, ну, с кем-"
"то другим. Кхм."

