#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Alright, see you around then."
msgstr "Ладно, ещё увидимся."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It takes only a moment to retrieve a suitable coin from your pockets, and "
"yet your interlocutor found enough time to disappear, having left a sharp "
"emptiness both in memory and the chair before you.  The anchor has been "
"neatly folded on the table."
msgstr ""
"Потребовалось мгновение, чтобы достать из карманов подходящую монету, и всё "
"же ваша собеседница нашла достаточно времени, чтобы исчезнуть, оставив "
"пустоту и в памяти, и на стуле перед вами. Якорь аккуратно сложен на столе."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
