#. ~ Description of mission ""God"-Slayer"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid ""
"A traumatized mercenary has claimed to have seen what you assume to be a "
"powerful monster.  Maybe you should investigate this for the benefit of "
"everyone."
msgstr ""
"Травмированный наёмник заявляет, что видел сильного монстра. Возможно, вам "
"следует изучить это на благо всех."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Attempt a friendly approach."
msgstr "Попробовать дружеский подход."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Leave the traveler to their trauma."
msgstr "Оставить путешественника со своей травмой."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Press on in search of a reaction."
msgstr "Разговорить дальше в поисках реакции."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid ""
"Show your map to the mercenary, and have them mark where they saw this "
"\"god\"."
msgstr "Показать свою карту наёмнику и предложить отметить место этого «бога»."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Try to find someone more interested in conversation."
msgstr "Найти кого-то более заинтересованного в разговоре."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
msgid "Yeah I'm sure I have seen that one too.  Try to stay safe."
msgstr ""
"Да, по-моему, он мне тоже попадался. Постарайся оставаться в безопасности."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&You spot the mercenary at the tail end of a deal.  \"Want in on the "
"business?  Still have a pair of ID cards looking for buyers.  Two army and "
"two science cards left, they sell together for 4 coins or not at all."
msgstr ""
"&Вы замечаете наёмницу. «Эй, хочешь кое-что? Парочка пропусков всё ещё ждёт "
"покупателя. Два военных пропуска и два пропуска учёных, продам за 4 монеты "
"все вместе или не продам вообще."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
