msgid ""
"&You spot the mercenary at the tail end of a deal.  \"Want in on the "
"business?  Still have a pair of ID cards looking for buyers.  Two army and "
"two science cards left, they sell together for 4 coins or not at all."
msgstr ""
"&Вы замечаете наёмника. «Эй, хочешь кое-что? Парочка пропусков всё ещё ждёт "
"покупателя. Два военных пропуска и два пропуска учёных, продам за 4 монеты "
"все вместе или не продам вообще."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"&You spot the mercenary at the tail end of a deal.  \"Want in on the "
"business?  Still have a pair of ID cards looking for buyers.  Two army and "
"two science cards left, they sell together for 4 coins or not at all."
msgstr ""
"&Наёмник говорит после сделки: «Эй, хочешь кое-что? Парочка пропусков всё "
"ещё ждёт покупателя. Есть два военных пропуска и два пропуска учёных, могу "
"продать за 4 монеты, что скажешь?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "Huh where do you get those from"
msgstr "А откуда ты их взял?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "Not a bargain bin kid, the price's the price."
msgstr "Это тебе не дешёвка, цена какая есть."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "Offer to buy them for 2 coins."
msgstr "Предложить купить их за 2 монеты."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "Oh, it looks like I don't actually have two coins right now…"
msgstr "Ох, похоже, у меня сейчас нет двух монет…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid "See you around then."
msgstr "Ещё увидимся."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "Sure whatever, two coins and its all yours."
msgstr "Конечно, две монеты и он твой."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid ""
"Well that'd be telling.  Suffice to say that a few friends found them, and "
"none of us are into the lab-dive business."
msgstr ""
"Ну, это долгая история. Скажу только, что их нашли кое-какие друзья, и никто "
"из нас не устраивает набеги на лаборатории."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "[2 HGC] Its a deal then."
msgstr "[2 ЗМЦ] Тогда, по рукам."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
msgid "[4 HGC] Its a deal."
msgstr "[4 ЗМЦ] По рукам."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary seems uncharacteristically upbeat, or perhaps just drunk.  "
"\"Found this neat gizmo in a bank run a few days ago.\"  <mypronoun> blurts "
"while procuring a small cube of etched glass from <mypossesivepronoun> "
"pocket.  \"Now, I have no use for such a thing, but perhaps you do.  What do "
"you say?  It's yours for 3 coins.\""
msgstr ""
"&Наёмница кажется необычно оптимистичной или, возможно, просто пьяна. "
"«Несколько дней назад мне попалась эта изящная штуковина в банке.» "
"Выпаливает она, доставая из своего кармана небольшой кубик травлёного "
"стекла. «Мне это не нужно, но, возможно, тебе пригодится. Что скажешь? Отдам "
"за 3 монеты»."

