msgid ""
"Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr ""
"Хорошо, ты меня убедил. Я возьму Джеремайю на обучение и покажу ему все "
"тонкости."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
