"Could be higher in a good year, but with the bugs as big as they are, the "
"monsters, the fallout, the blight…well, we'll be counting ourselves lucky if "
"we live long enough to starve.  No sense in worrying though, just got to put "
"one foot in front of the other and keep on going.  Those refugees are "
"counting on us."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
