msgstr "Я всё видел! А ну бросай что украл!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<acknowledged>"
#. ~ Generic acknowledgment of a command.  Comes up a lot and could use more variety.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I should be able to."
msgstr "Я справлюсь."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<meth_smoke>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC is near the avatar who is smoking meth.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I smell heresy."
msgstr "Я чую ересь."

