#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I trusted you, and you can't even provide food!"
msgstr "Мне пришлось довериться тебе, а ты даже еды достать не можешь!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_water_thanks>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after drinking water from a camp well.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I was parched, but now I am not."
msgstr "Я почти иссох, но теперь мне лучше."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<kill_player_h>"
#. ~ Hostile NPC complaint that they're attacking the avatar.  Could use more variety.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
