#. ~ Description of gun "rail-mounted crossbow"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "rail-mounted crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "rail-mounted crossbow"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"A kit to attach a pair of crossbow arms and a firing rail to the barrel of a "
"long firearm.  It allows crossbow bolts to be fired."
msgstr ""
"Набор для крепления на длинноствольное оружие пары арбалетных плечей и "
"направляющей. Требует арбалетных болтов для стрельбы."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "makeshift bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "makeshift bayonet"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift version of a bayonet that consists of a mere spike with some "
"string."
msgstr "Самодельный вариант штыка, состоящий из шипа и верёвки."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "firearm waterproofing"
#. ~ Description of "firearm waterproofing"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"A set of seals and gaskets that will allow a firearm to operate reliably "
"while submerged in water."
msgstr ""
"Набор прокладок и уплотнителей, дающих огнестрельному оружию возможность "
"работать, будучи погружённым в воду."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "blanching acorns (obsolete)"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"After a week of changing water and taste-testing, the acorns are no longer "
"bitter and ready to decant."
msgstr ""
"После недели смены воды и пробы на вкус жёлуди больше не горчат и готовы к "
"сливанию воды."

