#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Transportation"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Airports (including landing strips, hangars, parking areas and related "
"facilities), railroads and rail stations, and divided highways (related "
"facilities would include rest areas, highway maintenance areas, storage "
"areas, and on/off ramps).  Also includes docks, warehouses, and related land-"
"based storage facilities, and terminal freight and storage facilities.  "
"Roads and bridges less than 200 feet in width that are the center of two "
"differing land use classes will have the land use classes meet at the center "
"line of the road (i.e., these roads/bridges themselves will not be separated "
"into this class)."
msgstr ""
"Аэропорты (включая посадочные полосы, ангары, парковки и связанные "
"постройки), железные дороги и железнодорожные станции и автомагистрали "
"(связанные объекты включают места отдыха, места обслуживания шоссе и въезды/"
"съезды). Также включает доки, склады и связанные наземные объекты хранения, "
"а также грузовые терминалы. Если дороги и мосты шириной менее 60 м проходят "
"между двумя разными категориями земли, границы категорий пройдут по центру "
"дороги (то есть сами дороги и мосты не попадут в какую-либо категорию)."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Forest"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Areas where tree canopy covers at least 50% of the land.  Both coniferous "
"and deciduous forests belong to this class."
msgstr ""
"Области, где древесные кроны покрывают минимум 50% земли. Включает хвойные и "
"лиственные леса."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Cranberry bog"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Both active and recently inactive cranberry bogs and the sandy areas "
"adjacent to the bogs that are used in the growing process.  Impervious "
"features associated with cranberry bogs such as parking lots and machinery "
"are included.  Modified from DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODE 5."
msgstr ""
"Активные и недавно неактивные клюквенные болота и прилегающие к ним песчаные "
"области, участвующие в процессе выращивания. Включает связанные парковки и "
"оборудование. Модифицировано из DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODE 5."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Brushland/Successional"
msgstr "Кустарники"

#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_cemetery"
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json data/json/start_locations.json
msgid "Cemetery"
msgstr "Кладбище"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Commercial"
msgstr "Коммерческая застройка"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Cranberry bog"
msgstr "Клюквенное болото"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Cropland"
msgstr "Поле"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Saltwater Sandy Beach"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 1, 2, 3, 6, 10, 13, 17, and 19"
msgstr ""
"Водно-болотные угодья DEP (1:12 000) Коды водно-болотных угодий 1, 2, 3, 6, "
"10, 13, 17, и 19"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Saltwater Wetland"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 11 and 27."
msgstr "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 11 and 27."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Forested Wetland"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 14, 15, 16, 24, 25, and 26."
msgstr ""
"Водно-болотные угодья DEP (1:12 000) Коды водно-болотных угодий 14, 15, 16, "
"24, 25, и 26."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Non-Forested Wetland"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 4, 7, 8, 12, 23, 18, 20, and 21."
msgstr "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 4, 7, 8, 12, 23, 18, 20, and 21."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Water"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 9 and 22."
msgstr "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 9 and 22."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Multi-Family Residential"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Duplexes (usually with two front doors, two entrance pathways, and sometimes "
"two driveways), apartment buildings, condominium complexes, including "
"buildings and maintained lawns.  Note: This category was difficult to assess "
"via photo interpretation, particularly in highly urban areas."
msgstr ""
"Дуплексы (обычно с двумя дверями, двумя дорожками и иногда двумя выездами из "
"гаража), апартаменты, кондоминиумы, включая постройки и связанные газоны."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Participation Recreation"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Facilities used by the public for active recreation.  Includes ball fields, "
"tennis courts, basketball courts, athletic tracks, ski areas, playgrounds, "
"and bike paths plus associated parking lots.  Primary and secondary school "
"recreational facilities are in this category, but university stadiums and "
"arenas are considered Spectator Recreation.  Recreation facilities not open "
"to the public such as those belonging to private residences are mostly "
"labeled with the associated residential land use class not participation "
"recreation.  However, some private facilities may also be mapped."
msgstr ""
"Места, используемые людьми для активного отдыха. Включает футбольные поля, "
"теннисные корты, баскетбольные площадки, беговые дорожки, лыжные районы, "
"игровые площадки, велодорожки и связанные с ними парковки. В эту категорию "
"попадают места для отдыха в начальных и средних школах, но университетские "
"стадионы считаются Зрелищным отдыхом. Закрытые для публики места отдыха, "
"например, в частных домовладениях, почти всегда относятся к соответствующему "
"классу и не попадают в эту категорию. Однако категория может включать "
"некоторые частые заведения."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Pasture"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Fields and associated facilities (barns and other outbuildings) used for "
"animal grazing and for the growing of grasses for hay."
msgstr ""
"Поля и соответствующие постройки (амбары и прочее) для выпаса животных и "
"выращивания фуража."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Forest"
msgstr "Лес"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Forested Wetland"
msgstr "Заболоченные леса"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Orchard"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Fruit farms and associated facilities."
msgstr "Фруктовые фермы и связанные здания."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Cropland"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Generally tilled land used to grow row crops.  Boundaries follow the shape "
"of the fields and include associated buildings (e.g., barns).  This category "
"also includes turf farms that grow sod."
msgstr ""
"Возделанная почва для выращивания сельскохозяйственных культур. Границы "
"следуют форме полей и охватывают соответствующие постройки (например, "
"амбары). Также включает торфяные фермы."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Golf Course"
msgstr "Поле для гольфа"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Nursery"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Greenhouses and associated buildings as well as any surrounding maintained "
"lawn.  Christmas tree (small conifer) farms are also classified as Nurseries."
msgstr ""
"Теплицы и связанные здания, а также все окружающие газоны. Хвойные фермы "
"также считаются питомником."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "High Density Residential"
msgstr "Плотная жилая застройка"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Low Density Residential"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Housing on 1/2 - 1 acre lots.  See notes below for details on Residential "
"interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Жильё на участках 1/5 — 1/2 гектара. Смотрите примечания ниже насчёт деталей "
"об интерпретации жилых областей."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Medium Density Residential"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Housing on 1/4 - 1/2 acre lots.  See notes below for details on Residential "
"interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Жильё на участках 1/10 — 1/5 гектара. Смотрите примечания ниже насчёт "
"деталей об интерпретации жилых областей."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Very Low Density Residential"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Housing on > 1 acre lots and very remote, rural housing.  See notes below "
"for details on Residential interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Жильё на участках более 1/2 гектара и очень удалённые загородные дома. "
"Смотрите примечания ниже насчёт деталей об интерпретации жилых областей."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "High Density Residential"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Housing on smaller than 1/4 acre lots.  See notes below for details on "
"Residential interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Жильё на участках менее 1/10 гектара. Смотрите примечания ниже насчёт "
"деталей об интерпретации жилых областей."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Marina"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Include parking lots and associated facilities but not docks (in class 18)"
msgstr "Включает парковки и связанные объекты, но не доки (категория 19)"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Mining"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Includes sand and gravel pits, mines and quarries.  The boundaries extend to "
"the edges of the site's activities, including on-site machinery, parking "
"lots, roads and buildings."
msgstr ""
"Шахты, песчаные и гравийные карьеры. Границы следуют по краям деятельности и "
"включают технику, парковки, дороги и постройки."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Cemetery"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Includes the gravestones, monuments, parking lots, road networks and "
"associated buildings."
msgstr ""
"Включает надгробия, монументы, парковки, дорожные сети и связанные здания."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Golf Course"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Includes the greenways, sand traps, water bodies within the course, "
"associated buildings and parking lots.  Large forest patches within the "
"course greater than 1 acre are classified as Forest (class 3).  Does not "
"include driving ranges or miniature golf courses."
msgstr ""
"Включает лужайки, песчаные ловушки, водоёмы на территории поля, связанные "
"здания и парковки. Большие участки леса площадью более 1/2 гектара в "
"пределах поля определяются как Лес (категория 3). Не включает тренировочные "
"или миниатюрные поля."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Junkyard"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Includes the storage of car, metal, machinery and other debris as well as "
"associated buildings as a business."
msgstr ""
"Включает свалки машин, металла, техники и прочего мусора, а также связанные "
"постройки в рамках бизнеса."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Industrial"
msgstr "Промышленная застройка"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Junkyard"
msgstr "Свалка"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Waste Disposal"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Landfills, dumps, and water and sewage treatment facilities such as pump "
"houses, and associated parking lots.  Capped landfills that have been "
"converted to other uses are coded with their present land use."
msgstr ""
"Свалки, помойки, очистные сооружения (например, насосные станции) и "
"связанные парковки. Засыпанные свалки, переделанные под что-либо ещё, "
"кодируются их текущим использованием."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Urban Public/Institutional"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Lands comprising schools, churches, colleges, hospitals, museums, prisons, "
"town halls or court houses, police and fire stations, including parking "
"lots, dormitories, and university housing.  Also may include public open "
"green spaces like town commons."
msgstr ""
"Школы, церкви, колледжи, больницы, музеи, тюрьмы, ратуши, суды, полицейские "
"и пожарные станции с парковками, общежитиями и кампусами. Также может "
"включать открытые общественные зелёные места вроде исторических центров "
"города."

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Industrial"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Light and heavy industry, including buildings, equipment and parking areas."
msgstr ""
"Лёгкая и тяжёлая промышленность, включая здания, оборудование и парковки."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Low Density Residential"
msgstr "Жилая застройка низкой плотности"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Commercial"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Malls, shopping centers and larger strip commercial areas, plus neighborhood "
"stores and medical offices (not hospitals).  Lawn and garden centers that do "
"not produce or grow the product are also considered commercial."
msgstr ""
"Торговые комплексы и более крупные коммерческие зоны плюс мелкие магазинчики "
"и клиники (не больницы). Газоны и садовые центры, не производящие продукцию, "
"также считаются коммерческими."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Marina"
msgstr "Причал"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Medium Density Residential"
msgstr "Жилая застройка средней плотности"

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json data/json/zones.json
msgid "Mining"
msgstr "Добыча ископаемых"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Multi-Family Residential"
msgstr "Жильё для нескольких семей"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Non-Forested Wetland"
msgstr "Заболоченное безлесье"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Nursery"
msgstr "Питомник"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Open Land"
msgstr "Пустошь"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Transitional"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Open areas in the process of being developed from one land use to another "
"(if the future land use is at all uncertain).  Formerly identified as Urban "
"Open."
msgstr ""
"Открытые области в процессе развития от одного типа использования в другой "
"(если будущее использование пока неясно). Изначальное определение категории "
"— Открытая городская."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Orchard"
msgstr "Сад"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Participation Recreation"
msgstr "Место активного отдыха"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Pasture"
msgstr "Пастбище"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Powerline/Utility"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Powerline and other maintained public utility corridors and associated "
"facilities, including power plants and their parking areas."
msgstr ""
"Линии электропередач и другие общественные линии коммунальных услуг, а также "
"связанные объекты, включая электростанции с парковками."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Powerline/Utility"
msgstr "Электроэнергия"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Brushland/Successional"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Predominantly (> 25%) shrub cover, and some immature trees not large or "
"dense enough to be classified as forest.  It also includes areas that are "
"more permanently shrubby, such as heath areas, wild blueberries or mountain "
"laurel."
msgstr ""
"Земля главным образом (>25%) покрыта кустарниками и небольшими деревьями, "
"недостаточно плотными, чтобы считаться лесом. Также включает более "
"постоянные кустарниковые области, например, заросли вереска, дикой черники "
"или горного лавра."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Saltwater Sandy Beach"
msgstr "Солёный песчаный пляж"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Saltwater Wetland"
msgstr "Солёное болото"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Spectator Recreation"
msgstr "Место зрелищного отдыха"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Water-Based Recreation"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Swimming pools, water parks, developed freshwater and saltwater sandy beach "
"areas and associated parking lots.  Also included are scenic areas "
"overlooking lakes or other water bodies, which may or may not include access "
"to the water (such as a boat launch).  Water-based recreation facilities "
"related to universities are in this class.  Private pools owned by "
"individual residences are usually included in the Residential category.  "
"Marinas are separated into code 29."
msgstr ""
"Бассейны, аквапарки, благоустроенные пресные и солёные песчаные пляжи и "
"связанные парковки. Также включает области с видом на озёра и другие водоёмы "
"с доступом к воде или без (например, прокат лодок). Университетские водные "
"развлечения попадают в эту категорию. Частные бассейны в домах обычно "
"включены в категорию жилья, причалы в категорию 29."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Transitional"
msgstr "Промежуточная"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Transportation"
msgstr "Транспорт"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Spectator Recreation"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"University and professional stadiums designed for spectators as well as "
"zoos, amusement parks, drive-in theaters, fairgrounds, race tracks and "
"associated facilities and parking lots."
msgstr ""
"Предназначенные для зрителей университетские и профессиональные стадионы, а "
"также зоопарки, парки развлечений, кинотеатры под открытым небом, ярмарки, "
"гоночные треки и связанные с ними постройки и парковки."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Urban Public/Institutional"
msgstr "Городские общественные места"

#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Open Land"
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid ""
"Vacant land, idle agriculture, rock outcrops, and barren areas.  Vacant land "
"is not maintained for any evident purpose and it does not support large "
"plant growth."
msgstr ""
"Пустая земля, простаивающие поля, каменные породы и безлюдные области. "
"Пустая земля не служит никакой явной цели и не благоприятствует большим "
"растениям."

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Very Low Density Residential"
msgstr "Жильё очень низкой плотности"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Waste Disposal"
msgstr "Утилизация отходов"

#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
msgid "Water-Based Recreation"
msgstr "Водные развлечения"

#. ~ Name of NPC faction camp
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_special/specials.json
msgid "Holdouts"
msgstr "Несогласные"

#. ~ Name of NPC faction camp
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_special/specials.json
msgid "New England Church Retreat"
msgstr "Ретрит церкви Новой Англии"

#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_refugee_center"
#. ~ Name of NPC faction camp
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_special/specials.json
#: data/json/start_locations.json
msgid "Refugee Center"
msgstr "Центр беженцев"

#. ~ Name of NPC faction camp
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_special/specials.json
msgid "Tacoma"
msgstr "Такома"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "Unexplored"
msgstr "Неисследованно"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain_agricultural.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain_ranch_camp.json
#: data/mods/alt_map_key/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "barn"
msgstr "амбар"

