#. ~ Description of profession "Patient" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you made a vow: to fight for your "
"life, and to never give in to despair.  Now is the time to renew that vow."
msgstr ""
"Когда диагноз подтвердился, вы поклялись бороться за свою жизнь и никогда не "
"поддаваться отчаянию. Пришло время вспомнить свою клятву."

#. ~ Description of profession "Patient" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you made a vow: to fight for your "
"life, and to never give in to despair.  Now is the time to renew that vow."
msgstr ""
"Когда диагноз подтвердился, вы поклялись бороться за свою жизнь и никогда не "
"поддаваться отчаянию. Пришло время вспомнить свою клятву."

#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Patient" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you signed up for a series of "
"experimental bionic surgeries that saved your life.  The problem is, they "
"needed power, and now the power's out.  Find a new place to charge your "
"batteries or you might wind up worse off than before."
msgstr ""
"Когда диагноз подтвердился, ты согласилась на серию экспериментальных "
"бионических операций, которые в итоге спасли твою жизнь. Теперь ты здоровее, "
"чем когда-либо была, благодаря набору бионических систем, работающих за счёт "
"твоих метаболических функций. Используй правильно свой второй шанс на жизнь."

#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Patient" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you signed up for a series of "
"experimental bionic surgeries that saved your life.  The problem is, they "
"needed power, and now the power's out.  Find a new place to charge your "
"batteries or you might wind up worse off than before."
msgstr ""
"Когда диагноз подтвердился, ты согласился на серию экспериментальных "
"бионических операций, которые в итоге спасли твою жизнь. Теперь ты здоровее, "
"чем когда-либо был, благодаря набору бионических систем, работающих за счёт "
"твоих метаболических функций. Используй правильно свой второй шанс на жизнь."

#. ~ Description of profession "Vandal" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the riots started, you took to the streets to join in the mayhem.  Now "
"the old world is gone, and you're ready to bring havoc to the new one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Vandal" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the riots started, you took to the streets to join in the mayhem.  Now "
"the old world is gone, and you're ready to bring havoc to the new one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Rifleman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell "
"is war, but you never thought it would be this bad."
msgstr ""
"Когда вы были молоды, вы мечтали стать солдатом. Война - это ад, а ад - это "
"война, но вы никогда не думали, что всё произойдет вот так."

#. ~ Description of profession "Rifleman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell "
"is war, but you never thought it would be this bad."
msgstr ""
"Когда вы были молоды, вы мечтали стать солдатом. Война - это ад, а ад - это "
"война, но вы никогда не думали, что всё произойдет вот так."

#. ~ Description of profession "Surgeon" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether you worked in aesthetics, oncology, or orthopedics, you're going to "
"have to get used to the fact that pretty much everyone with your skillset is "
"now first and foremost a trauma surgeon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Surgeon" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether you worked in aesthetics, oncology, or orthopedics, you're going to "
"have to get used to the fact that pretty much everyone with your skillset is "
"now first and foremost a trauma surgeon."
msgstr ""

