msgstr ""
"«Мама сказала, что скоро вернется, но она еще не вернулась домой. Мне очень "
"страшно»."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mommy said the monsters are not real, but I saw one today.  It was in our "
"backyard.\""
msgstr ""
"«Мама сказала, что монстры ненастоящие, но сегодня я видела одного. Оно было "
"у нас на заднем дворе»."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
