"\n"
"Don't go in <city>, big horde 25-50\n"
"Watch for black goop\n"
"They get up after death, smash corpse\n"
"Gov building outside town, almost died, secrets???\n"
"Feed Besse 3 times daily\n"
"Don't eat the <zombie>s\n"
"Big community up north, good spot?\n"
"Rhode Island still good?  Heard rumors"
msgstr ""
