msgstr "Это грузовой отсек с шестимесячным запасом пеммикана."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "Here is no kitten but only rock, rock and no kitten and the sandy road."
msgstr ""
"Здесь нет котенка, а только камень, камень, и никакого котенка и песчаная "
"дорога."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "Here's Pete Peterson.  His batteries seem to have long gone dead."
msgstr "Здесь Пит Питерсон. Похоже, его батарейки уже давно сели."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "Hey, I bet you thought this was kitten."
msgstr "Эй, держу пари, ты думал, что это котенок."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
