#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "If it's one thing, it's not another."
msgstr "Если это что-то одно, то это не что-то иное."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "It is -- I just feel something wonderful is about to happen."
msgstr "Это - я просто чувствую, что вот-вот произойдет что-то чудесное."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL licensed
