msgid "You stumble upon Bill Gates' stand-up act."
msgstr "Вы наткнулись на стендап-выступление Билла Гейтса."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "You suddenly yearn for your distant homeland."
msgstr "Вы вдруг тоскуете по своей далекой родине."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "You've found the fabled America Online disk graveyard!"
msgstr "Вы нашли легендарное кладбище дисков America Online!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "You've found the fish!  Not that it does you much good in this game."
msgstr "Вы нашли рыбу! Это не то, что было бы полезно в этой игре."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid ""
"You've found the snows of yesteryear!  So that's where they all went to."
msgstr "Вы нашли  прошлогодний снег! Вот куда он весь девается."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Additional items from current official robotfindskitten game, GPL licensed
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "You've found… oh wait, that's just a cat."
msgstr "Вы нашли… Ой, подождите, это просто кот."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "Your State Farm Insurance™ representative!"
msgstr "Представитель вашей страховой компании State Farm Insurance™!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "Your long lost twin's roommate."
msgstr "Давно потерянный близнец вашего соседа по комнате."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "Your sense of dignity."
msgstr "Ваше чувство собственного достоинства."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "…thingy???"
msgstr "…вещица???"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"Don't point that thing at me!\""
msgstr "«Не тыкай в меня этой штукой!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"Get away from here!\""
msgstr "«Проваливай отсюда!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"Get the fuck away from me!\""
msgstr "«Держись от меня подальше, нахрен!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"I didn't mean to do it!\""
msgstr "«Я совсем не это имел в виду!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"I had to do it!\""
msgstr "«Мне пришлось это сделать!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"I should never have trusted you!\""
msgstr "«Мне не стоило тебе доверять!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"It wasn't my fault!\""
msgstr "«Это была не моя ошибка!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"No!  Stop!\""
msgstr "«Нет! Хватит!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"Stay away from me!\""
msgstr "«Держись от меня подальше!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"Stop laughing at me!\""
msgstr "«Хватит надо мной смеяться!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"That's not true!\""
msgstr "«Это неправда!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"They made me do it!\""
msgstr "«Меня заставили это сделать!»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"What are you!?\""
msgstr "«Да кто ты такой?»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"What do you think you're doing?\""
msgstr "«Что это ты делаешь?»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_shout"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "\"What do you want from me?\""
msgstr "«Чего ты от меня хочешь?»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "'Tis but a flesh wound."
msgstr "Это всего лишь рана на теле."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "*cough cough* Go on without me…"
msgstr "*кха-кха* Дальше тебе придётся без меня…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Am I gonna die?"
msgstr "Неужели я умру?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_drop>"
#. ~ In the future, it would be preferable for the snippet to use the object's name, instead of "Your weapon"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "An electric shock shoots into your hand from Your weapon!"
msgstr "Ваше оружие стреляет электрическим разрядом вам в руку!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Are you hurt?"
msgstr "Ты ранен?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Are you supposed to be bleeding?"
msgstr "А кровь так и должна всё время течь из раны?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Arrest that <name_b>!"
msgstr "Арестуйте <name_b>!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Best friends forever!"
msgstr "Лучшие друзья навсегда!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Come on!  What're we doing here?!"
msgstr "Да ладно! Что мы здесь делаем!?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Dang, you look terrible."
msgstr "Черт, ты выглядишь ужасно."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Did you see that <name_b>!?  Be careful."
msgstr "Видишь <name_b>!? Будь осторожней."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you really think so?"
msgstr "Ты и правда так думаешь?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you think it'll rain today?"
msgstr "Как думаешь, сегодня будет дождь?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Don't leave me alone!"
msgstr "Не оставляй меня одного!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Don't touch me."
msgstr "Не трогай меня."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_hear_sound"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "From the <random_direction> <up_or_down> you hear <random_sound>"
msgstr "Вы слышите <random_sound> на <random_direction> <up_or_down>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_hear_sound"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "From the <random_direction> you hear <random_sound>"
msgstr "Вы слышите <random_sound> на <random_direction>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Go kill that <name_b>!  NOW!"
msgstr "Иди и убей <name_b>! Сейчас!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Gross, you're bleeding all over me."
msgstr "Мерзость, ты заливаешь меня кровью!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hey, can you hear me?"
msgstr "Эй, ты меня слышишь?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hey, fix me up will ya?"
msgstr "Эй, почини меня, ладно?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hey, let's go kill that <name_b>!"
msgstr "Эй, давай убьём <name_b>!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hey, you're hurt."
msgstr "Эй, тебе больно."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hold fast, you can do this."
msgstr "Держись, ты сможешь сделать это."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "How do I bring you back?"
msgstr "Как мне вернуть тебя назад?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "How many do you think we've killed?"
msgstr "Как думаешь, сколько мы уже отправили на тот свет?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I can still fight, don't replace me!"
msgstr "Я всё ещё могу сражаться, не бросай меня!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I know!"
msgstr "Я знаю!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I love you!"
msgstr "Я тебя люблю!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I need healing!"
msgstr "Мне нужно лечение!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I need to kill that <name_b>!"
msgstr "Мне нужно убить <name_b>!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I spy with my little eye… oh right, I don't have eyes."
msgstr "Я смотрю своим маленьким глазком… ах да, у меня нет глаз."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I think I know what I'm doing."
msgstr "Я думаю я знаю что я делаю."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I think that <name_b> wants to talk to you."
msgstr "По-моему, <name_b> хочет поговорить с тобой."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I thought you were my friend."
msgstr "Мне казалось, мы друзья."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I want to kill that <name_b>!"
msgstr "Я хочу убить <name_b>!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I want to watch that <name_b> bleed!"
msgstr "Я хочу посмотреть как <name_b> истекает кровью!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'll keep you safe."
msgstr "Я буду держать тебя в безопасности."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm bored."
msgstr "Мне скучно."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm your best friend, right?"
msgstr "Я же твой лучший друг, так?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Is anybody here a doctor!?"
msgstr "Среди вас есть доктор!?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Is it really time for that?"
msgstr "Думаешь, сейчас подходящее время?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "It hurts all over…"
msgstr "Всё болит…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I… I can't move my legs!"
msgstr "Я… я не чувствую своих ног!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Let me kill something already!"
msgstr "Дай мне уже кого-нибудь прибить!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Let me kill that <name_b>!  Please?"
msgstr "Дай мне убить <name_b>! Ну пожалуйста?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Look out!  That creature is dangerous!"
msgstr "Осторожно! Это существо опасно!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Lovely weather we're having, huh?"
msgstr "Классная погодка, а?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Maybe we can reason with that creature!"
msgstr "Может быть, нам удастся урезонить это существо!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Medic!"
msgstr "Медик!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "No way man."
msgstr "Ну уж нет, дружище."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "No!  I can't die now!"
msgstr "Нет! Я не могу умереть сейчас!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Oh God.  Please don't die.  Not now!"
msgstr "О, боже. Прошу, не умирай. Не сейчас!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Oh, there you are."
msgstr "О, вот ты где."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Please don't die!  No one else lets me kill things!"
msgstr ""
"Пожалуйста, не умирай! Никто другой не разрешал мне убивать всех подряд!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Please don't go."
msgstr "Прошу, не уходи."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Shhh… I think I heard something."
msgstr "Тсс… Кажется, я что-то слышу."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Shouldn't you put a bandage on that?"
msgstr "Может тебе всё-таки стоит перебинтовать рану?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Shut up!  Don't lie to me."
msgstr "Заткнись! Не ври мне."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "So what if everyone you know is dead, you've still got me, right?"
msgstr ""
"Ну и что, если все, кого ты знаешь, мертвы, я всё ещё есть у тебя, верно?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "So, got any hobbies?"
msgstr "Ну, у тебя есть какие-нибудь хобби?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Sorry about earlier, can you forgive me?"
msgstr "Извини за то, что было раньше. Ты меня простишь?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Sorry, I can't hear you."
msgstr "Извини, я тебя не слышу."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Stop!  Look at that monster."
msgstr "Стой! Посмотри на вон того монстра!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Take out a few more before you die!"
msgstr "Забери с собой ещё парочку, прежде чем ты умрёшь!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Tell me where it hurts."
msgstr "Скажи мне где болит."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That <name_b> doesn't deserve to live!"
msgstr "<name_b> не заслуживает права жить!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That <name_b> hasn't met it's quota."
msgstr "<name_b> не заработал до квоты."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That <name_b> must be pulling the strings…"
msgstr "<name_b>, должно быть, тянет за ниточки…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That <name_b> wants to be your friend!"
msgstr "<name_b> хочет стать вашим другом!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That guy deserves a raise!"
msgstr "Этот парень требует повышения!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That intruder looks like it wants to party."
msgstr "Этот вторженец, похоже, хочет начать вечеринку."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That's not jelly on your coat lad, that's blood!"
msgstr "Это не желе, это кровь!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That's not true, is it?"
msgstr "Это же неправда, так ведь?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "There's something following us, I can feel it."
msgstr "За нами кто-то следует, я это чувствую."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "They got me!"
msgstr "Они меня достали-таки!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "They're all gone…"
msgstr "Их больше нет…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "This place is dangerous, we shouldn't be here."
msgstr "Здесь опасно, нам не стоит тут находиться."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "This trip was pointless."
msgstr "Бессмысленно было приходить сюда."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Try not to drop me."
msgstr "Постарайся не уронить меня."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Wait, that <name_b> needs to die!"
msgstr "Погоди, нам нужно убить <name_b>!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We should give that <name_b> a stern talking to."
msgstr "Нам следует сурово поговорить с <name_b>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We should go home, it's not safe here."
msgstr "Нам пора домой, здесь небезопасно."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We're in over our heads!"
msgstr "Мы в затруднительном положении!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What's for dinner?"
msgstr "Что на обед?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "Как тебя зовут?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "When's your next doctor's appointment?"
msgstr "Когда у тебя следующая запись к врачу?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Where the hell am I?"
msgstr "Где я, чёрт побери?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why are you following me?"
msgstr "Почему ты меня преследуешь?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why did you leave me?"
msgstr "Почему ты оставляешь меня?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why would you do that?"
msgstr "Зачем ты это делаешь?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Wow!  Everything looks so… nevermind."
msgstr "Вау! Все выглядят так… впрочем, неважно."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You are being watched… by THEM."
msgstr "За вами наблюдают… ОНИ."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_formication"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can feel insects crawling all over you."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, как по вам ползают насекомые."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_formication"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can feel something wriggling underneath your skin."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, как что-то извивается под кожей."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can feel your heart racing, something is watching you."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, как бьется ваше сердце, что-то наблюдает за вами."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can put me back together, right?"
msgstr "Ты же сможешь меня починить, а?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel a mounting sense of impending doom."
msgstr "Вас захлёстывает предчувствие неминуемой беды."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid ""
"You feel as if everyone in the world must be playing a sick prank on you."
msgstr ""
"На вас накатывает ощущение, будто каждый в этом мире играет с вами злую "
"шутку."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_formication"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel bugs crawling on you."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, как по вам ползают насекомые."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_grandiose"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel in full control of the situation."
msgstr "Вы ощущаете полный контроль над ситуацией."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_formication"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel itchy all over."
msgstr "У вас все чешется"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_formication"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel larvae wriggling beneath the skin."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, как черви извиваются под кожей."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like the world is out to get you."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, что весь мир охотится за вами."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like you should get back home."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете, что вам пора вернуться домой."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_formication"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like you're covered in bugs."
msgstr "Вам кажется, что вы покрыты насекомыми."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel lost.  Painfully and irrevocably lost."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете себя потеряно. Безвозвратно потеряно."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_grandiose"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid ""
"You feel that this must be a global reality show, in which you are the star."
msgstr "Вы понимаете, что всё это — глобальное реалити-шоу, а вы его звезда."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_grandiose"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid ""
"You gain the sudden realization that you are the creator of the universe."
msgstr "Вы внезапно понимаете, что вы — творец Вселенной."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_grandiose"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid ""
"You gain the sudden realization that you must have been responsible for the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr "Вы внезапно осознаёте, что Катаклизм случился именно из-за вас."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You get the odd feeling that your thoughts are not your own."
msgstr "У вас странное ощущение, будто ваши мысли на самом деле не ваши."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You gonna let me die too?!"
msgstr "Ты позволишь умереть и мне тоже!?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You hungry?  I've got plenty of food."
msgstr "Хочешь есть? У меня есть много еды."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_grandiose"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You increase all your skills to level 10."
msgstr "Вы повышаете все навыки до уровня 10."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You look hurt, did I do that?  I'm sorry."
msgstr "Тебе больно. Это из-за меня? Прости."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_grandiose"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid ""
"You now know that you are a secret agent, kept alive to continue serving the "
"government."
msgstr ""
"Теперь вы знаете, что вы секретный агент и вас держат в живых, чтобы вы "
"служили правительству."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You seriously need friends."
msgstr "Тебе точно нужны друзья."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You should take a shower."
msgstr "Тебе следует принять душ."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You thirsty?  I've got water."
msgstr "Хочешь пить? У меня есть вода."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're bleeding you know."
msgstr "У тебя кровь идёт, ты знаешь?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're gonna die out here."
msgstr "Ты умрешь здесь."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're in charge?  We're screwed."
msgstr "Ты здесь за главного? Мы влипли."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're not going to die are you?"
msgstr "Ты же не собираешься умирать?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're nothing without me, NOTHING!"
msgstr "Ты ничто без меня, НИЧТО!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You've told me already."
msgstr "Ты уже говорил мне это."

#. ~ Snippet in category "broken_limb"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your limb breaks!"
msgstr "Ваша конечность ломается!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_formication"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your skin feels itchy."
msgstr "У вас чешется кожа."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_drop>"
#. ~ In the future, it would be preferable for the snippet to use the object's name, instead of "Your weapon"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
