#. ~ Description of UI widget "zenfs_complete_status_display"
#: data/json/ui/zenfs/sidebar-thick.json
msgid ""
"A large <color_yellow>status graph</color>, complete with "
"<color_yellow>health meters</color> for all major body parts, "
"<color_yellow>body graphs</color> for wetness, encumbrance & temperature, as "
"well as <color_yellow>diet</color>, <color_yellow>movement</color>, "
"<color_yellow>mental state</color> and <color_yellow>base stats</color>."
