"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: One special slaughter mission will be assigned during each "
"expedition, rewarding warp shards if you kill a certain number of "
"specifically targeted enemies before returning home."
msgstr ""
"Каким-то образом вы понимаете, что статуя взывает к чему-то, что может "
