msgstr "Умер от зомби-заражения."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "Everything's so dark.  You can feel it, you don't have much time left."
msgstr ""
"Тьма захватывает вас. Вы чувствуете, что у вас осталось не так много времени."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie wound"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "Redness is creeping up from your wound.  You feel weak, and look pale."
msgstr ""
"Краснота ползёт вокруг раны. Вы чувствуете слабость и выглядите бледным."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid ""
"The area around your zombie bite is festering and red, and you're feeling "
"hot and cold at once."
msgstr ""
"Область вокруг укуса зомби покраснела и гноится. Вас одновременно бросает и "
"в жар, и в холод."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie wound"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "The area around your zombie scratch is looking a little red."
msgstr "Область вокруг вашей раны зомби немного покраснела."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "Why is it so cold in here?  And so hot, at the same time?"
msgstr "Почему здесь так холодно? И одновременно так жарко?"

#. ~ Death message of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "You succumb to your zombie bite."
msgstr "Вы стали жертвой укуса зомби."

#. ~ Death message of effect type "Zombie wound, Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "You succumb to your zombie contagion."
msgstr "Вы стали жертвой зомби заражения."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "You've been bitten.  It's bad."
msgstr "Вас укусили. Это плохо."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zombie wound, Zombie contagion"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "You've been cut by a zombie.  Did it get infected?"
msgstr "Вас поранил зомби. Это заразно?"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie bite"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
msgid "You've got a painful bite from a zombie.  You know how this ends."
msgstr "Вас больно покусал зомби. Вы знаете, чем это закончится."

