msgstr " ВНИМАНИЕ: Хирург отсутствует"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:5626
msgid ""
"\n"
" Using the Autodoc without an operator can lead to <color_light_cyan>serious "
"injuries</color> or <color_light_cyan>death</color>.\n"
" By continuing with the operation you accept the risks and acknowledge that "
"you will not take any legal actions against this facility in case of an "
"accident. "
