#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1339
msgid ""
"\n"
"- Attack speed and accuracy in melee and ranged combat\n"
"- Aim and reload speed with ranged weapons\n"
"- Small bonus to melee critical hit chance\n"
"- Picking locks and disarming traps\n"
"- Avoiding or escaping grabs and traps\n"
"- Chance of preventing damage to weapons in melee combat\n"
"- Chance of avoiding damage to items when making repairs\n"
"- Bonus to success rate when modifying guns\n"
"- Stealing success rate\n"
