#~ msgid ""
#~ "A potent sleep aid extracted from mutated poppy seeds.  Effective, but as "
#~ "an opioid it can be addictive."
#~ msgstr "Мощное снотворное, полученное из мутировавших семян мака."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A professional-grade multi-cooker, with a battery slot for camping trips "
#~ "or tailgating.  There is a dish cooking inside it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Мультиварка для профессиональной готовки. Имеет разъем под батарею для "
#~ "готовки на природе или сохранения еды теплой. Внутри что-то съедобное."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A professional-grade multi-cooker, with a short electric cord.  Its "
#~ "multitude of settings and features promise to handle any sort of cooking, "
#~ "from parboiling potatoes to cooking curry to popping popcorn.  There's no "
#~ "manual, but you're sure you can work it out."
